Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.30,0:00:48.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 我们开始吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.80,0:00:52.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,集中精力 速度 我就是速度\N{\fnArial\fs30}Focus. Speed. I am speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.87,0:00:57.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,1个优胜者 42个失败者\N{\fnArial\fs30}One winner, forty two losers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.18,0:00:59.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会把失败者当早餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}I eat losers for breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.26,0:01:03.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我过去常那样说吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did I used to say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.60,0:01:05.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的先生 你常说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes sir... you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.06,0:01:07.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然了 你一直这样说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah sure. You say that all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.73,0:01:09.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,板牙 你在这里做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mater! What are you doing in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.20,0:01:11.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不想让你觉得寂寞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I didn't want you to be lonely.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.27,0:01:16.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢 可我正在准备比赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, thank you but I'm kind of preparing for a race
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.23,0:01:17.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,需要点安静\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need a little quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.46,0:01:19.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的 给你安静 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alright. You got it buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.04,0:01:22.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大家好 听好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey every buddy, listen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.98,0:01:27.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我最好的朋友闪电麦坤需要安静 绝对安静\N{\fnArial\fs30}My best friend Lightning McQueen need quiet. Perfect quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.38,0:01:30.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 刚才到哪儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, where was I.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.92,0:01:35.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,比赛 真正的比赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Racing. Real racing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.06,0:01:40.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那不是比赛 甚至都不是圣代之旅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh! That ain't racing. That wasn't even a sundae drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.12,0:01:42.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那只比一圈 顶现在500圈\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was one lap racing is 500 of those.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.72,0:01:45.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所有人一圈圈地力争上游\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody fighting to move up lap after lap.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.74,0:01:48.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,内外道相距咫尺从不接触\N{\fnArial\fs30}Inside outside inches apart never touching.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.31,0:01:50.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在那才叫比赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now that's racing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.61,0:01:54.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这位蓝天博士我无法反驳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I can't argue with "The" Doc Hudson.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.19,0:01:57.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说得多对呀 多对呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}How true. How true.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.85,0:02:02.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 闪电 准备好了吗 - 好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}-  Hey Lightning. Are you ready? -  Oh yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.77,0:02:03.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,闪电准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lightning is ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.85,0:02:08.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这次是为你比的 博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one is for you Doc.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.35,0:02:24.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,《赛车总动员3：极速挑战》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.72,0:02:29.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,加油车手们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on stickers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.75,0:02:32.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,布雷特到了 加油麦坤\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is Bret coming through. Go McQueen.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.33,0:02:37.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,闪电麦坤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lightning McQueen.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.41,0:02:45.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,卡尔 你的转向灯开着呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey Cal, your blinkers are on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.69,0:02:47.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么 没有啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? No, it's not. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.17,0:02:49.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的转向灯才开着呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your blinkers are on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.89,0:02:50.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,恢复得不错 卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good comeback Cal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.05,0:03:07.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,正在进站的是闪电麦坤\N{\fnArial\fs30}And into the pit goes lightning McQueen,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.59,0:03:09.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比·斯威夫特和卡尔·韦瑟斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby Swift and Cal Weathers.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.57,0:03:11.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这三辆车看着很有意思 是不是 达雷尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}These three are fun to watch. Aren't they Darrell?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.69,0:03:14.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,鲍勃 不好说他们在场内还是场外更有意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know Bob, I can't tell they have more fun on or off the track.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.21,0:03:21.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你又在洗车了 卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're geting the car wash too Cal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.50,0:03:23.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 你才在洗车\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you're getting a car wash McQueen.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.82,0:03:25.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在去追上他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get them now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.53,0:03:41.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,闪电 你是怎么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lightning, how do you...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.56,0:03:43.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在与鲍比和卡尔比赛时保持专注的\N{\fnArial\fs30}keep your focus racing against Bobby and Cal?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.06,0:03:46.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我认为秘诀就是我们彼此尊重\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean I think the key is we respect each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.25,0:03:47.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这些家伙的确出类拔萃\N{\fnArial\fs30}These guys are real class act.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.53,0:03:50.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,祝贺你 茶杯蛋糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Congratulations cupcake.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.07,0:03:53.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们会付出代价的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, they're gonna pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.77,0:04:04.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,加油 恐龙石油车队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go go Dinoco!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.69,0:04:06.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今天真是场伟大的胜利 卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great win today, Cal.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.23,0:04:09.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你香农 我们朝目标迈出了巨大...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you Shannon, it was great move towards our.. Hey hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.60,0:04:11.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,技师 进站\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guido! Pit-stop...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.30,0:04:14.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别再说了 真有趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ha ha knock it off! Real funny...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.02,0:04:22.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,时速314公里 你的车速\N{\fnArial\fs30}Speed 196m/h. Your speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.90,0:04:24.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,加油 保持下去 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Keep it going buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.23,0:04:36.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的赞助商们今天还高兴吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are my sponsors happy today?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.31,0:04:38.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天 你别再赢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop winning for crying out loud,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.29,0:04:40.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们的减震膏不够卖了\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're running out of bumper cream to sell.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.35,0:04:41.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,闪电麦坤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lightning McQueen!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.67,0:04:43.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大特克斯 我最喜欢的对手还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, big Tex. How's my favorite competitor?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.01,0:04:46.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只要你一句话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just say the word,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.45,0:04:49.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就打电话给恐龙石油车队 让你取代他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll put call off the Dinoco team and replace him with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.30,0:04:51.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我能听见 对吗 我就在这儿呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I can hear you right? I'm right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.31,0:04:53.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再见 卡尔 下周见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye Cal, see you next week.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.78,0:04:55.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,见不着了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.47,0:04:57.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别这样 我在开玩笑呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh come on now, I am joking.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.76,0:04:58.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,加油 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roll it buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.84,0:05:02.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,赢了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And meet buddy too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.30,0:05:08.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,又一次超棒的结尾正在酝酿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another great finish in the making.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.15,0:05:09.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,麦坤和斯威夫特车头紧咬着车尾\N{\fnArial\fs30}McQueen and Swift nose- to- nose.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.94,0:05:11.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,后面的视野怎么样 鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's the view back there Bobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.18,0:05:13.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你最好不要哔哔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you would better not bleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.39,0:05:14.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,否则 我一下就超过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or, I'll blow right past you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.50,0:05:18.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最后一圈了 麦坤领先\N{\fnArial\fs30}The flap is out it's the final stretch, McQueen in the lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.69,0:05:21.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 让我看看你有什么能耐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, let's see what you got.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.69,0:05:34.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是杰克逊风暴赢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, it's Jackson Storm for the win.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.36,0:05:35.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大写的郁闷\N{\fnArial\fs30}A huge upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.08,0:05:37.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,闪电和鲍比甚至都没看到他追上来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even Lightning or Bobby never saw him coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.89,0:05:39.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,启动快只是一个方面\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's one thing to start fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.13,0:05:40.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可我们还没见过任何人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we haven't seen anyone
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.64,0:05:43.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,以那种速度和动力冲线\N{\fnArial\fs30}cross the line with that kind of speed and power.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.51,0:05:47.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,自从年轻的闪电麦坤露面以来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since young Lightning McQueen first arrived on the scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.15,0:05:50.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 鲍比 那是谁 - 那是\N{\fnArial\fs30}-  Hey Bobby, who is that? -  That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.52,0:05:53.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 杰克逊风暴 - 没错 他是个新人\N{\fnArial\fs30}-  Jackson Storm -  Yeah, he's one of the rookies.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.60,0:06:00.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢 我很感激 非常感谢 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, I appreciate it. Thank you very much. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.56,0:06:05.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,杰克逊风暴 对吗 今天表现得不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Jackson Storm, right? Great race today.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.32,0:06:07.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢 麦坤先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow, thank you Mr. McQueen.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.06,0:06:08.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不知道对我来说\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have no idea what a pleasure
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.98,0:06:10.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,终于打败你有多高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}it is for me to finally beat you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.76,0:06:12.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! Thanks... wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.08,0:06:15.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等一下 你刚是说见到还是打败\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on..Did you say meet or beat?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.68,0:06:17.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想你听清了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you heard me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.47,0:06:19.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 什么 - 麦坤在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}-  What... -  McQueen over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.53,0:06:21.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,风暴 我们能拍几张照片吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Storm, can we get some pictures?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.07,0:06:22.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可以 可以 拍吧 来拍吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah yeah, come on. Let's get a picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.30,0:06:23.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,知道吗 想拍多少拍多少\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what. You can get a ton of pictures.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.74,0:06:24.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为这里这位冠军\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because the champ here
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.98,0:06:27.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是我多年来的榜样\N{\fnArial\fs30}has been a role model of mine for years now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.65,0:06:29.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是说很多年\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I mean a lot of years.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.74,0:06:31.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 我喜欢这家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, I love this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.15,0:06:37.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想我刚碰了个神经病\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I touched a nerve.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.66,0:06:50.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎回到路霸点评\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome back to chicks picks and Chick Hicks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.20,0:06:54.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是主持人活塞杯前任及永远的冠军路霸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm your host former and forever Piston Cup champion Chick Hicks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.71,0:06:56.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,新消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}This just in.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.74,0:06:58.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,新手杰克逊风暴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rookie Jackson Storm slaps
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.30,0:07:00.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,打破了闪电麦坤的传奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}the proverbial door on Lightning McQueen.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.76,0:07:05.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是我自己打败闪电麦坤都没这么开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I couldn't have enjoyed it more if I'd beaten McQueen myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.68,0:07:06.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等 我打败过他呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, wait. I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.72,0:07:11.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别说我了 还是给大家讲讲这个故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now enough about me. Here to tell you how it happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.09,0:07:13.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,计算专家娜塔莉·塞尔坦小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is professional number cruncher Miss Natalie Certain.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.87,0:07:15.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很荣幸来到这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is pleasure to be here Chick
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.64,0:07:18.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其实我更喜欢被称为统计分析师\N{\fnArial\fs30}and actually I prefer the term statistical analyst.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.55,0:07:21.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的 所以这个新人杰克逊风暴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, so who is this mysterious newcomer
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.58,0:07:24.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有什么秘籍 为什么这么快呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jackson Storm and why is he so darn fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.82,0:07:27.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好好研究一下数据就会发现并不神秘\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's no mystery if you study the data Mr. Hicks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.56,0:07:28.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,杰克逊风暴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jackson's Storm is part
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.97,0:07:31.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,采用了下一代高科技赛车的新技术\N{\fnArial\fs30}of the next generation of high-tech Racers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.63,0:07:33.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,和那些明日黄花不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unlike the veterans of yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.96,0:07:36.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这样的老家伙吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh what, old-timers like this guy ha ha...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.97,0:07:38.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.96,0:07:41.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,风暴的最高速是数字完成的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Storm achieves his top speeds by exploiting the numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.90,0:07:45.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也就是赛车数据 胎压和下压力等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}I refer of course to racing data: Tire pressure, downforce.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.64,0:07:47.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,质量分布 气体力学\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weight distribution, aerodynamics
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.16,0:07:51.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是像风暴这样的下一代赛车的秘密武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}and nextgen's like Storm are taking advantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.07,0:07:52.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,赛车世界正在剧变\N{\fnArial\fs30}The racing world is changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.96,0:07:54.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且是变得更好\N{\fnArial\fs30}And for the better if it
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.17,0:07:56.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我的老朋友闪电都下台了的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}means my old pal Lightning is down for the count.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.59,0:07:57.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I right Certain?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.69,0:08:00.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果说我能确定什么的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if I'm Certain of anything Chick.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.04,0:08:04.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那就是这个赛季肯定要更有趣了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's that this season is about to get even more interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.39,0:08:06.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我告诉你 达雷尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell you what Darrell.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.13,0:08:08.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,杰克逊风暴绝对给观众留下了深刻印象\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jackson Storm has certainly made an impact.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.41,0:08:11.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在赛场上又增加了六台新车\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got six more next generation rookies in the field
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.78,0:08:14.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且是六台老车让位的结果\N{\fnArial\fs30}with six veterans fired to clear the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.45,0:08:17.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,早上好 伙计 我们的活神仙今天好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good mornin' champ. How's our living legend today?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.30,0:08:20.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还好 谢谢 要是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still very much alive. Thank you. Now, I would appreciate if...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.93,0:08:22.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真不敢相信我居然\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe I get to race
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.50,0:08:24.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,能在闪电麦坤的告别赛上和他较量\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Lightning McQueen in his farewell season.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.90,0:08:26.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.97,0:08:29.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么 绿灯了 祝好运 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}What... The green flag... Good luck out there champ.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.92,0:08:31.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你会需要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are gonna need it
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.78,0:08:41.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,风暴和下一代赛车更高效的一个原因是\N{\fnArial\fs30}One reason Storm and the next gens are more efficient
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.13,0:08:45.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们每一圈都能保持在最佳路线上\N{\fnArial\fs30}their ability to hold the optimum racing line every single lap
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.15,0:08:46.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,新手第三场胜利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Win number 3 for the rookie sensation.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.23,0:08:50.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,风暴可以说独树一帜 其中一个原因是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Storms in a class of his own and a big reason for that
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.17,0:08:52.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最新最高端模拟器训练\N{\fnArial\fs30}training on the newest cutting- edge simulators.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.75,0:08:56.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这机器创造的赛车体验真实到\N{\fnArial\fs30}These machines create a virtual racing experience so real,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.32,0:08:58.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,赛车手都不用再实地训练了\N{\fnArial\fs30}racers never even have to go outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.08,0:09:02.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,风暴的实力简直前无古人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Storms' ability to hold that line is like nothing we've ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.45,0:09:04.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,四圈了 真的假的啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four in a row... Are you kidding me
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.41,0:09:06.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,阻力系数降低百分之二\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two percent lower drag coefficient
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.43,0:09:07.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,结束的也十分漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a finish!!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.88,0:09:09.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,下压力提高5%\N{\fnArial\fs30}5% increase in downforce
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.80,0:09:10.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,幸运7\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucky number seven
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.98,0:09:13.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最高速度增加1.2%\N{\fnArial\fs30}1.2 % higher top speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.14,0:09:17.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,活塞杯冠军路霸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Piston Cup winner Chick Hicks
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.55,0:09:19.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,和风暴一般席卷赛场的\N{\fnArial\fs30}here with the racer taking the circuit by Storm
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.33,0:09:23.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,杰克逊风暴 再次轻松赢过老伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jackson Storm. Another easy win over old katchow,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.50,0:09:25.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或者说 吊车尾\N{\fnArial\fs30}or should I say the kaboos
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.02,0:09:27.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为他总是在后面 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}because he's always in the back. Am I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.61,0:09:30.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不不不 路霸 麦坤个很厉害的冠军\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, Chick, McQueen is a crafty veteran champ,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.96,0:09:33.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是赛车界的知名前辈\N{\fnArial\fs30}he's the elder statesman of the sport you know
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.25,0:09:35.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只有我才能打败他\N{\fnArial\fs30}takes everything I got to beat him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.53,0:09:38.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的假的啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you gotta be kidding me
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.94,0:09:43.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么改进才能让麦坤重新成为霸主\N{\fnArial\fs30}What changes are you gonna make to get McQueen back on top
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.18,0:09:45.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,麦坤有新训练模式吗 他要退休了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}will McQueen try new training method? Is he prepare to retire?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.06,0:09:48.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,各位 别太夸张 只是点小挫折\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys let's not overreact.. It's just a slump..
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.67,0:09:49.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,下周我们就能打败他\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll get him next week
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.99,0:09:51.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 就到这里吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}okay that's enough
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.61,0:09:52.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}No comment
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.19,0:09:54.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,卡尔·韦瑟斯的退休做评价吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}not even about Cal Weathers retiring!!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.61,0:09:55.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait..What!!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.24,0:09:57.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,卡尔·韦瑟斯 他要金盆洗手了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cal Weathers!! He's hanging up his light- years
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.83,0:10:02.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 无可奉告\N{\fnArial\fs30}no, no comment on that either
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.08,0:10:08.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}hey, Cal
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.38,0:10:12.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,退休 怎么回事啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}hey... retirement!! What's going on!!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.12,0:10:16.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有次我问我叔叔\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I asked my uncle
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.39,0:10:18.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,该怎么判断该什么时候退休\N{\fnArial\fs30}once how I'd know when it was time to stop
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.06,0:10:20.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道他怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}you know what he said
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.74,0:10:23.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,年轻人会让你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}the youngsters will tell you
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.91,0:10:30.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们有过很棒的比赛时光\N{\fnArial\fs30}we had some good times together
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.37,0:10:33.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这将是我最怀念的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna Miss that the most I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.69,0:10:35.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.95,0:10:44.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,路霸 更多改进在后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}More changes ahead Chick
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.60,0:10:46.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,每周都能见到老旧赛车退休\N{\fnArial\fs30}every week we've seen veteran
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.38,0:10:49.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就像今晚的卡尔·韦瑟斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Racers either retire like Cal Weathers tonight
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.31,0:10:51.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或者被开除 以便\N{\fnArial\fs30}or fired to make room for
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.18,0:10:54.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为这些更快的赛车腾位子 还没完\N{\fnArial\fs30}these younger faster Racers and it's not over yet
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.57,0:10:59.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大家好 车迷们 欢迎来到\N{\fnArial\fs30}hello racing fan welcome to the Los Angeles 500
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.07,0:11:02.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,活塞杯赛季洛杉矶五百强决赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}final race of the Piston Cup season.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.40,0:11:05.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我能做到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can do this
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.20,0:11:07.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我为你们赛车快十年了啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I raced for you guys almost 10 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.82,0:11:08.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉 布里克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry Brick
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.66,0:11:09.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我已经决定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}my mind's made up
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.48,0:11:11.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要把你的号码给别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm giving your number to someone new
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.87,0:11:13.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我去年还赢了两次呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}hey! I had two win last year
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.28,0:11:14.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老规矩已经变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}old sport's changing..
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.70,0:11:16.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey Bobby
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.61,0:11:18.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道布里克怎么了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}do you know what's happening with Brick...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.97,0:11:22.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你 等等 你不是鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}You.. wait! You're not Bobby
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.16,0:11:25.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我叫丹尼 哥们\N{\fnArial\fs30}my name is Danny bro
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.10,0:11:40.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哥们 你的朋友都去哪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}hey champ, where would all your friends go
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.78,0:11:44.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最后一次检查轮胎\N{\fnArial\fs30}a final check of his tires
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.06,0:11:45.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,风暴已稳居首发位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}as Storm settles into the pole position
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.58,0:11:49.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们来看看这个赛季最棒的一场比赛吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}let's see in this season's one of the great race
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.33,0:12:07.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是这样 哥们\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's it buddy
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.93,0:12:18.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有40圈 目前领跑的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}40 laps to go and race leader
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.50,0:12:21.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,杰克逊风暴 他正奋力驶向维修站\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jackson Storm is making his way on the pit road
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.06,0:12:22.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,麦坤紧随其后\N{\fnArial\fs30}with McQueen on his tail
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.66,0:12:25.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一次不错的换胎也许就能\N{\fnArial\fs30}a good stop here could mean the difference between
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.23,0:12:26.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,分出胜负\N{\fnArial\fs30}victory and defeat
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.96,0:12:29.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快快快 再快点啊吉多 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}come on, come on, come on, faster Guido. Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.15,0:12:31.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我得在他之前就上路\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta go back out there before he does.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.66,0:12:32.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,吉多 赶快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guido... hurry up
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.05,0:12:36.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,麦坤完成了好一次换胎\N{\fnArial\fs30}what a pit- stop by McQueen
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.16,0:12:41.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他领跑了 他能坚持住吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}man, he just got the lead can he hold on it
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.13,0:12:48.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,麦坤 你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}hey McQueen, you alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.28,0:12:50.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着 别担心 哥们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, don't you worry pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.00,0:12:52.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你跑得不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had a good run
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.27,0:12:53.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,享受你的退休之战吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}enjoy your retirement.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.72,0:12:55.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,风暴再度领跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Storm takes back the lead
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.33,0:12:57.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,字幕难以置信 麦坤在落后\N{\fnArial\fs30}unbelievable! McQueen is fading
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.13,0:12:59.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,麦坤在落后\N{\fnArial\fs30}McQueen is fading
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.04,0:13:01.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迅速落后\N{\fnArial\fs30}fading fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.03,0:13:05.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不不不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No... no... no... no!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.11,0:13:08.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.44,0:14:05.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎回到活塞杯评论\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome back to Piston Cup talks
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.13,0:14:08.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,连日来我们除了评论什么也不做\N{\fnArial\fs30}around- the- clock where we do nothing but talk racing
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.40,0:14:09.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.50,0:14:09.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}let's get to it
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.72,0:14:11.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然要先说说闪电麦坤\N{\fnArial\fs30}starting of course with Lightning McQueen
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.13,0:14:13.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,本赛季还有两周就要开赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}the season start just two weeks away
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.86,0:14:15.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,目前尚无官方声明\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's still no official announcement
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.82,0:14:18.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但95号创下了他的史上最糟记录\N{\fnArial\fs30}but with number 95 coming off his worst year on record
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.96,0:14:20.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可别杀了传话人 乡亲们\N{\fnArial\fs30}don't shoot the messenger here folks
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.88,0:14:22.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我认为可以推测\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it's safe to assume
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.55,0:14:25.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,闪电麦坤的比赛生涯已经终结\N{\fnArial\fs30}that Lightning McQueen's racing days are over
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.71,0:14:28.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,同时 杰克逊风暴似乎越发迅速了\N{\fnArial\fs30}meanwhile Jackson Storm is looking even faster than.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.49,0:14:39.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,6号和12号\N{\fnArial\fs30}The number six and the number 12 cars
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.75,0:14:41.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还在争夺首位\N{\fnArial\fs30}are still fighting it out to the lead
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.33,0:14:43.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等 他来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but wait, here he comes
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.98,0:14:47.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,超凡哈德森·大黄蜂来敲门了\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's the fabulous Hudson hornet knocking at their door
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.57,0:14:49.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今天他的袖子里藏了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}what's he got up his sleeve today
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.35,0:14:54.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来了 一次精彩的转弯 他超过了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}and there it is with one incredible move he has passed them
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.66,0:14:56.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大黄蜂遥遥领先\N{\fnArial\fs30}the hornet takes this decisive lead
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.50,0:15:00.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把众车远远甩在身后\N{\fnArial\fs30}he's left the pack behind
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.15,0:15:02.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他的机工长斯莫基非常满意\N{\fnArial\fs30}his crew chief smokey is loving it..
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.25,0:15:04.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,难以置信\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's unbelievable
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.01,0:15:06.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 出问题了\N{\fnArial\fs30}oh no, this is trouble
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.75,0:15:08.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哈德森·大黄蜂失去了控制\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Hudson hornet has lost control
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.72,0:15:11.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哈德森·大黄蜂失去了控制\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Hudson hornet has lost control
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.33,0:15:15.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,本该是个欢庆场面\N{\fnArial\fs30}what should have been a scene
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.75,0:15:18.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,却变成了悲剧\N{\fnArial\fs30}of jubilation has turned tragic here today folks
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.53,0:15:20.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们等着哈德森·大黄蜂的进一步消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}we await news on the Hudson hornets condition
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.42,0:15:22.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,经历了此重创\N{\fnArial\fs30}after such a devastating
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.68,0:15:24.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们只能希望今天的比赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}crash we can only hope that this race today
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.59,0:15:26.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不会成为他的最后一场\N{\fnArial\fs30}wasn't his last
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.46,0:15:34.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们终于被重新拼凑了起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}when I finally got put together and went back
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.74,0:15:37.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,回去期待着热烈欢迎 你知道他们怎么说的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}expecting a big welcome, you know what they said?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.55,0:15:39.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你已经是历史了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are history, moved
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.83,0:15:42.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,挪到下一个新手旁边站好\N{\fnArial\fs30}right on to the next rookie standing in line
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.86,0:15:46.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还有很多本事\N{\fnArial\fs30}there was a lot left in me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.29,0:15:48.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我从来没有机会展示\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never got a chance to show
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.07,0:16:04.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,车祸 哈德森·大黄蜂退出赛季\N{\fnArial\fs30}crash! The Hudson hornet is out for the season
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.79,0:16:07.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,贴纸\N{\fnArial\fs30}hey, stickers
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.93,0:16:10.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}hey, sal
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.57,0:16:11.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你感觉如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}how are you feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.47,0:16:15.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,挺好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah great
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.40,0:16:17.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,非常好\N{\fnArial\fs30}really really great
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.34,0:16:19.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你又在想医生的事了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}you have been thinking about Doc again?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.25,0:16:22.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.89,0:16:26.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是他们告诉他他不行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you know they told him when he was done.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.01,0:16:28.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是他决定的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't decide.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.78,0:16:31.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不希望医生的遭遇\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want what happened to Doc
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.27,0:16:33.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,发生在我身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}to happen to me
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.66,0:16:34.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但那并没有发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}but that hasn't happened
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.61,0:16:37.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对 但我没法出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}no, but I can't go out on the
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.55,0:16:40.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,走上赛道做以前的事了 不行的\N{\fnArial\fs30}track and do the same old thing. It won't work
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.69,0:16:42.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那就改变一下 试试新东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}then change it up. Try something new.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.45,0:16:44.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道 莎莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know Sally
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.64,0:16:46.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别怕失败\N{\fnArial\fs30}don't fear failure
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.55,0:16:48.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要怕没有机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}be afraid of not having the chance
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.61,0:16:51.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你有机会 医生当年没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}you have the chance. Doc didn't
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.58,0:16:54.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要么抓住机会 要么就继续这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you can either take it or you can do what you've been doing
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.94,0:16:57.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,连续几个月待在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}sitting in here for month
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.08,0:17:00.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对了 我喜欢你对这里的改造\N{\fnArial\fs30}and by the way I love what you've done with the place
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.72,0:17:04.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怪兽电影灯 麝香味的空气清新剂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean the monster movie Lightning and the musky air freshener
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.61,0:17:07.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别让别人告诉你你不能比赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}and don't let anyone tell you you're not working that primer
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.55,0:17:10.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我从没发现你比现在更有魅力\N{\fnArial\fs30}because wow, I have never found you more attractive
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.96,0:17:13.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我已经待在这臭气里好几分钟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and now that I've been in here for a couple of minutes the stench
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.64,0:17:15.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我都有点习惯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm getting kind of used to it
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.05,0:17:17.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 莎 我明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}okay sal, I get it. I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.58,0:17:21.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想你 闪电 我们都想你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I Miss you Lightning. We all do
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.74,0:17:28.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,试试新东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}try something new, huh
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.31,0:17:31.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,成功了吗 莎莉小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, did it work, Miss Sally?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.04,0:17:35.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你有用你律师般的说服力说服他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you set him straight with your lawyerly powers of persuasion?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.56,0:17:37.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他准备好开始训练了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he ready to start training?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.46,0:17:39.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,臭贴纸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, stinky stickers.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.36,0:17:43.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我准备好了 板牙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes Mater, I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.54,0:17:47.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的命运自己把握\N{\fnArial\fs30}I decide when I'm done.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.27,0:17:49.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我一直希望你能这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was hoping you'd say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.73,0:17:50.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好 但我有个主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, but I got an idea
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.96,0:17:53.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我需要跟锈锈和灰灰商量 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'm gonna need to talk to Rusty and Dusty, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.74,0:17:57.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我去给他们打电话 给他们打电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I'll get them on the horn, yeah get them on the horn.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.93,0:18:01.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,糟糕 要打喷嚏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oops, oh no, got a sneeze
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.95,0:18:07.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,该死 憋回去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dadgum, I lost it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.58,0:18:08.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,回见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I will see you through.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.29,0:18:12.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,打出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found it...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.00,0:18:14.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, watch your steps.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.43,0:18:21.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...环形车道\N{\fnArial\fs30}with a circular driveway.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.12,0:18:25.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们应该到这里来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You boys need to get your Rusty tails down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.28,0:18:27.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我以你的名字创造出了一种酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I created a drink in your honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.41,0:18:30.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,除锈灵保险杠酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, the rust-eze medicated bumper balm
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.20,0:18:33.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,比板牙卖得还快\N{\fnArial\fs30}it goes down faster than El Mater following a bag off.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.62,0:18:36.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,锈锈和灰灰 伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rusty and Dusty, hey guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.60,0:18:38.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你来了 很高兴见到你 闪电\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey there he is, good to see you, Lightning.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.09,0:18:40.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢 伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.06,0:18:42.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大家都在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow, you are all here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.65,0:18:45.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉伙计 你是希望私下聊吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry buddy, did you want this call to be private?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.10,0:18:46.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不板牙 这样最好不过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No Mater. This is perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.51,0:18:50.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,感谢大家...对我不离不弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, thanks everyone for... for sticking by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.53,0:18:52.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我花了些时间弄明白 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It took me a while to figure it out, but
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.41,0:18:55.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道现在我是时候该做出些改变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know now it's time for me to make some changes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.79,0:18:57.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,改变 什么样的改变\N{\fnArial\fs30}Changes! What kind of changes?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.04,0:19:00.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,该做什么就是他的改变\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which feel to do is his change man.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.71,0:19:02.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你说对了 辉哥 - 真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}-  You're right Fillmore -  Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.93,0:19:04.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以我要宣布一件事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which is why I have an announcement to make.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.43,0:19:08.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我做了很久的思想斗争\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've thought long and hard about it,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.24,0:19:10.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,翻来覆去想了很久\N{\fnArial\fs30}done a lot of soul- searching and
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.22,0:19:11.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,考虑了所有的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}considered all of the options,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.77,0:19:15.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最终决定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I finally decided,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.43,0:19:18.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你真的想继续比赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do want to keep racing?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.26,0:19:20.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,开什么玩笑 我当然想继续比赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you kidding! Of course I want to keep racing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.24,0:19:26.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,硬气一秒 等等 我一直都知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man for a second, wait a minute... I knew that the whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.02,0:19:29.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,伙计们 我要创造新的赛季记录\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, I'm talking about making this my best season yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.77,0:19:31.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们一直都希望你能这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were hoping you'd say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.40,0:19:33.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,问题就在于我要是想快过风暴\N{\fnArial\fs30}The thing is if I'm gonna be faster than Storm,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.82,0:19:35.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就得接受他那样的训练\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to train like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.33,0:19:36.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}We hear you buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.42,0:19:38.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,闪电 我们希望你能一早\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lightning, we want you on the road
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.22,0:19:39.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就来赛道\N{\fnArial\fs30}first thing in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.53,0:19:44.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这样你就能看到崭新的除锈灵赛车中心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you can come out and see the brand new rust-eze racing center.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.59,0:19:48.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等 什么 除锈灵赛车中心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, what! rust-eze racing center?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.38,0:19:50.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错 有所有高级排钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it's got all the fancy bells and
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.56,0:19:52.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,汽笛 孩子们这些天都在训练\N{\fnArial\fs30}whistles that the kids are training on these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.82,0:19:54.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们会把导航发给迈克货车\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll send Mackie boy all the directions,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.77,0:19:56.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,赶快动身吧 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}now get moving, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.89,0:19:58.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.03,0:19:59.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.61,0:20:03.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你也来吧 我们有两组备胎\N{\fnArial\fs30}You too come, we offer two back of the tire.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.77,0:20:06.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,麦坤 我们可以重头再来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, McQueen we can race in primer man.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.94,0:20:08.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.90,0:20:14.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,雷蒙 太艺术了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ramone, you have done it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.72,0:20:18.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,简直就是轮上的西斯廷教堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like the Sistine Chapel on wheels.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.15,0:20:21.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等着我吧 风暴\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am coming for you Storm.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.82,0:20:32.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎回来 你看上去不一样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome back, you look different.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.52,0:20:33.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Obviously.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.75,0:20:34.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看起来准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.60,0:20:37.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,奇诺来了 借过 借过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guido, come. Excuse me. Excuse me. Coming through.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.97,0:20:40.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别带上那些菜鸟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't get those rookies in the trunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.56,0:20:41.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的 再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.54,0:20:42.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,搞定他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go get them tiger.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.02,0:20:44.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大伙佛罗里达见\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll see you guys in Florida.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.59,0:20:45.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再见 麦坤\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you McQueen.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.79,0:20:46.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别忘了给我们打电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't forget calling.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.89,0:20:48.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck in college.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.60,0:20:50.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,莎莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey Sal,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.45,0:20:52.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.90,0:20:53.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,随时效劳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.29,0:20:54.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.02,0:20:55.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.77,0:20:57.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,更爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Love you more.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.14,0:20:59.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,除锈灵赛车中心 我们来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}rust-eze racing center, here we come.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.19,0:21:01.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,出发了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time to head.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.70,0:21:55.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,除锈灵赛车中心\N{\fnArial\fs30}rust-eze racing center.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.83,0:22:11.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,麦坤 麦坤\N{\fnArial\fs30}McQueen! McQueen!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.27,0:22:13.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看到风暴的最新记录了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you seen the latest record Storm's been setting?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.86,0:22:15.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你有考虑过退休吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you given any thought to retirement?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.67,0:22:18.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,够了 不接受提问 借过\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is enough, no questions, excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.56,0:22:22.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,后退 后退\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back off! Back off!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.55,0:22:25.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不不不 谢谢你 再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, thank you. B ye bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.01,0:22:31.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 奇诺 难以置信 - 狗仔 呸\N{\fnArial\fs30}-  Guido, can you believe them! -  Paparazzi..Phew.
