Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.72,0:22:46.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.78,0:22:47.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.75,0:22:48.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do I think?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.71,0:22:49.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,难以置信\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's unbelievable
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.87,0:22:54.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也就是个舒适低调的小地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you know it's kind of a cozy humble little place.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.17,0:22:55.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,伙计们你们是怎么做到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys how did you ever do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.67,0:22:56.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你告诉他还是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to tell him or
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.84,0:22:59.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我该告诉他吗 - 你先 你来 你来\N{\fnArial\fs30}-  should I tell him, -  You start.Go ahead. Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.72,0:23:01.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们把除锈灵公司卖了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We sold rust-eze
