Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.23,0:23:08.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们卖掉了除锈灵?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sold rust-eze?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.54,0:23:09.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有个大好消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all good news
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.49,0:23:11.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们明白你需要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}we just realized that you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.04,0:23:13.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,东西是我们给不了的\N{\fnArial\fs30}needed something that we couldn't give you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.48,0:23:16.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们正值风华正茂\N{\fnArial\fs30}if I'm right the time was right for us too
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.30,0:23:18.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是说我们不如我们的外表那般年轻帅气\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean we are not as young and handsome as we look
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.85,0:23:20.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大实话 再说了这个叫斯特林的家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that's true. Besides this Sterling fellow
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.88,0:23:23.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他有你所需的高科技东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}he's got every high- tech thing you'll ever need
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.88,0:23:26.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一切我们想给你但给不了你的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}everything we wanted to give you but couldn't
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.42,0:23:28.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,斯特林 谁是斯特林\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, whoa, Sterling! Who is Sterling?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.94,0:23:30.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,闪电麦坤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lightning McQueen
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.88,0:23:32.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你干得很认真 搭档\N{\fnArial\fs30}You made some serious time partner
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.83,0:23:34.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的新赞助者\N{\fnArial\fs30}your new sponsor
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.30,0:23:37.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他是东岸的挡泥板之王\N{\fnArial\fs30}he's the mud flap king of the eastern seaboard
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.74,0:23:40.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎来到除锈灵赛车中心\N{\fnArial\fs30}welcome to the rust-eze racing center
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.31,0:23:44.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不知道我有多期待这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}you have no idea how much I've been looking forward to this
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.58,0:23:46.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢斯特林先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}thanks Mr...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.61,0:23:47.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托 不要叫先生了 直接叫我斯特林\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, no Mr. Just Sterling
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.88,0:23:50.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我一直都是你的粉丝 能做你的赞助商\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have been a fan of yours forever and to be your sponsor
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.72,0:23:52.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,实在是太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}how great is that
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.10,0:23:54.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,简直太感谢锈锈和灰灰了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't thank Rusty and Dusty here enough
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.39,0:23:55.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,顺便说下 谈判过程很艰难\N{\fnArial\fs30}tough negotiators by the way
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.98,0:23:58.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你太恭维我们了 不过请不要停\N{\fnArial\fs30}oh- ho, you flatter us. But don't stop
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.89,0:24:01.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不管怎样 我只想打个招呼\N{\fnArial\fs30}anyway, I just wanted to say a quick hello
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.55,0:24:02.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请尽情享受\N{\fnArial\fs30}take as much time as you need
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.52,0:24:05.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这里的大门随时为你敞开\N{\fnArial\fs30}doors are always open guys
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.54,0:24:08.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看见没\N{\fnArial\fs30}see!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.79,0:24:21.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我肯定会想念为你们赛车的日子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I sure am gonna Miss racing for you guys
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.34,0:24:26.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,知道吗 你给了我们很多回忆 闪电\N{\fnArial\fs30}you know, you gave us a lot of great memories Lightning
