Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.48,0:24:31.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇哦 说得真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}wow that's good
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.22,0:24:34.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你好 闪电\N{\fnArial\fs30}hey Lightning,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.33,0:24:36.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不管怎样 别像我兄弟那样开车\N{\fnArial\fs30}whatever you do. Don't drive like my brother
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.53,0:24:38.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别像我兄弟那样开车\N{\fnArial\fs30}don't drive like my brother
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.26,0:25:08.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你喜欢这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}so, you like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.13,0:25:09.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你好 斯特林先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, hey Mr. Sterling
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.32,0:25:13.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,墙上都是我的职业生涯\N{\fnArial\fs30}my career on a wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.39,0:25:17.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,更棒的是你也没忘了博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice of you included Doc
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.51,0:25:19.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然 他是你的导师\N{\fnArial\fs30}well, of course. He was your mentor
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.25,0:25:23.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,失去他是这项运动的一大损失\N{\fnArial\fs30}losing him left a giant hole in the sport
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.65,0:25:24.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.86,0:25:29.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,泥土罐 神圣的泥土\N{\fnArial\fs30}jars of dirt.. "Sacred" Dirt
