Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.61,0:25:40.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就在我们外面的火球海滩路边\N{\fnArial\fs30}just down the road and our very own fireball beach right outside
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.45,0:25:43.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是\N{\fnArial\fs30}hey, is that...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.44,0:25:45.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,格伦艾伦的一点沥青\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bit of asphalt from Glen Allen
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.28,0:25:46.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我第一次获胜\N{\fnArial\fs30}my first win
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.82,0:25:49.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你真的是我的粉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}you really are a fan
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.79,0:25:53.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,确实 我也是你未来的粉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am and a fan of your future
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.80,0:25:55.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你准备好了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}you ready for it
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.26,0:25:57.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}definitely
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.75,0:26:01.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,首先 我们给你来个更现代一点的造型\N{\fnArial\fs30}first let's get you into a more contemporary look.
