Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.70,0:26:21.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别傻了 赛车没有窃听器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be crazy race cars don't have bugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.20,0:26:25.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不错吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow... not bad ha
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.55,0:26:27.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太惊人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}this is really impressive
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.05,0:26:28.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个中心这么快就变成了\N{\fnArial\fs30}this center has quickly become
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.58,0:26:30.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,年轻赛车手最梦寐以求的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}the most coveted destination for young Racers
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.00,0:26:31.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有朝一日能培养出我们自己的赛车队\N{\fnArial\fs30}training to make our team someday
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.49,0:26:34.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你将在这里训练直到你去佛罗里达\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it's where you'll train until you leave for Florida
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.61,0:26:38.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跑步机 风洞 虚拟现实\N{\fnArial\fs30}treadmills, wind tunnels, virtual reality
