Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.27,0:26:57.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,交互赛车模拟器\N{\fnArial\fs30}of interactive race simulation
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.71,0:27:01.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,XDL24超级加强版马克·C\N{\fnArial\fs30}the xdl 24 gts Mark c
