Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.88,0:27:09.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,杰克逊·风暴希望他有这个型号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jackson Storm wishes he had this model
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.62,0:27:21.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,感觉和真的赛道一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}it is just like been on a real track to put your hours in
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.61,0:27:23.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 让我们的赛道热闹起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}okay, let's hit the track most
