Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.31,0:27:35.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,准备好碰面招呼打败他\N{\fnArial\fs30}ready to meet it, greet it and defeat it
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.99,0:27:38.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 调高转速\N{\fnArial\fs30}alright, now bring up those rpm s
