Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.22,0:27:55.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这就对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here you go
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.13,0:27:56.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是朵云彩\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're a cloud
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.47,0:27:57.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴 库尔特\N{\fnArial\fs30}shut up Kurt
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.39,0:27:59.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,困难来咯 库尔特 准备好了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}here come the bugs Kurt you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.69,0:28:04.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我这次没闭眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I kept my eyes open this time
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.85,0:28:07.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,得看到赛道才行 不会吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}gotta see that track. Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.46,0:28:08.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,又想家了 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Homesick again people
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.07,0:28:16.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,取得胜利\N{\fnArial\fs30}win for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.91,0:28:20.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她训练年轻选手来克服他们的障碍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow, she trains young Racers to push through their own obstacles
