Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.81,0:28:34.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想给你介绍一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like to introduce you
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.40,0:28:35.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,闪电麦坤\N{\fnArial\fs30}to Lightning McQueen
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.27,0:28:36.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我听说你是个大师\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hear you're the maestro.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.79,0:28:39.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,斯特林先生 你刚说闪电麦坤来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Sterling, did you say Lightning McQueen was here?
