Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.01,0:34:44.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.30,0:34:52.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你将要成为赛车界最大的品牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are about to become the biggest brand in racing.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.86,0:34:53.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们说的可是\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are talking about saturation
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.92,0:34:56.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,全世界范围内的\N{\fnArial\fs30}on all continents for every demographic
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.94,0:35:00.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,电影交易 商业广告 产品代言\N{\fnArial\fs30}movie deals, in- commercials , product endorsements,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.46,0:35:01.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,挡泥板\N{\fnArial\fs30}mud flaps,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.47,0:35:04.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然 你会拥有超出想象的财富\N{\fnArial\fs30}of course, you will be rich beyond belief.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.27,0:35:05.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得你已经有名气了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think you're famous now?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.43,0:35:09.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我以为你会为模拟赛的事生气\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you'd be mad about the simulator.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.41,0:35:11.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得这很不错 斯特林先生 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean this is all great, Mr. Sterling, I guess but.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.44,0:35:15.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不确定 我从没想过自己会成为一个品牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.I never really thought of myself as a brand.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.65,0:35:18.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 是我吗 我可能是你最狂热的粉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no. Do I? I'm a fan maybe your most avid.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.10,0:35:21.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我把这视作你的遗产\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think of this as your legacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.68,0:35:27.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听起来像是你不再比赛后的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It sounds like something that happens after you're done racing.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.52,0:35:32.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,斯特林先生 这是要做什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Sterling. What is this about?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.57,0:35:36.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,闪电 我不会让你比赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Lightning! I'm not gonna race you...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.28,0:35:38.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么 不让我比赛是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What!...what do you mean not racing me?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.28,0:35:39.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,稍等 稍等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on! Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.29,0:35:40.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我去不了弗罗里达\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not going to Florida.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.49,0:35:41.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,闪电\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lightning!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.30,0:35:45.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你完全不知道能让你来这我有多激动\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have no idea how excited I was to get you here,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.92,0:35:48.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我知道 我知道你会恢复状态的\N{\fnArial\fs30}because I knew, I knew you'd be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.29,0:35:51.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这会成为本年度的复出故事 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}This gonna be the comeback story of the year but
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.34,0:35:56.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的速度和表现并不适合那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}your speed and performance just aren't where they need to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.73,0:35:57.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.86,0:36:00.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们说的是模拟器上的速度\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're talking about speed on a simulator.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.73,0:36:02.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这听上去多荒谬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen how crazy that sounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.71,0:36:04.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着 我在想办法帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm trying to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.36,0:36:07.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,作为你的赞助商没问题 但是同时作为朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}As your sponsor yes, but also as your friend,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.16,0:36:10.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的比赛时光即将收尾了\N{\fnArial\fs30}your racing days are coming to an end.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.51,0:36:13.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你每次输掉比赛 都会对自己造成损耗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everytime you lose, you damage yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.24,0:36:15.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是说破坏品牌形象吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damage the brand you mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.90,0:36:17.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,闪电 拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Lightning. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.17,0:36:20.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你已经完成了比赛 现在该进入下一阶段\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've done the work now move on to the next phase,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.88,0:36:22.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,得到回报\N{\fnArial\fs30}and reap the reward.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.96,0:36:25.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,比赛就是回报 这些东西才不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}The racing is the reward not the stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.67,0:36:28.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不想赚钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to cash in.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.04,0:36:30.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想体验每小时200英里的快感\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to feel the rush of moving 200 miles an hour
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.62,0:36:31.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想要比别的车跑得快\N{\fnArial\fs30}inches from the other guys
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.95,0:36:34.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让我自己能比我所想的还快\N{\fnArial\fs30}pushing myself faster than I thought I could go
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.49,0:36:36.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那才是奖励 斯特林先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's the reward Mr. Sterling.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.50,0:36:38.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,闪电 拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Lightning. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.17,0:36:43.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我能做到的 我能 我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I can do this. I can, I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.47,0:36:45.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会像我和博士那样训练的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll train like I did with Doc
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.51,0:36:46.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会让我的轮胎放肆奔跑的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get my tires dirty
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.69,0:36:48.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,整个佛罗里达都会留下我的印迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}on every turn track from here in the Florida
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.02,0:36:50.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以在火球海滩上训练\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can start right there on
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.27,0:36:52.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很多老赛车届大牛在那里训练过\N{\fnArial\fs30}fireball beach where all the old greats used to race
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.51,0:36:54.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让你的轮胎放肆奔跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get your tires dirty
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.01,0:36:57.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这样你就能比暴风跑得快了\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's how you're gonna get faster than Storm
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.02,0:36:58.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes! Exactly!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.67,0:37:00.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是说好好训练\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean sacred dirt, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.94,0:37:04.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,斯特林先生 如果你在乎我能传承\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Sterling if you care about my legacy,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.46,0:37:05.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,博士的传统\N{\fnArial\fs30}the one that Doc started
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.10,0:37:09.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你就让我做吧 我保证我会赢的\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'll let me do this. I promise you I will win.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.04,0:37:11.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.26,0:37:13.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要求的太危险了\N{\fnArial\fs30}what you're asking it's to risky
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.21,0:37:16.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托 你喜欢我的计划的 我能看出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, you like it. I can tell
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.14,0:37:18.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有点像\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's got that little comeback
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.02,0:37:20.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,卷土重来的感觉 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}story of the year feel to it, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.49,0:37:25.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就一场\N{\fnArial\fs30}One race
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.47,0:37:30.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你没有赢了佛罗里达的比赛 你就退休\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you don't win at Florida, you'll retire
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.69,0:37:33.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我输了 我就退休\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look... if I don't win also I will hold the mud flaps you got
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.22,0:37:37.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但如果我赢了 我就想做什么就做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}but if I do win, I decide when I'm done
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.98,0:37:38.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,成交\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deal
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.66,0:37:41.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,成交\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.07,0:37:44.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你 斯特林先生 你不会后悔的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you Mr. Sterling. You won't be sorry
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.88,0:37:46.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just one thing and this
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.28,0:37:48.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只是因为我不喜欢冒险\N{\fnArial\fs30}is only because I don't like taking chances
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.93,0:37:50.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你得带个人和你一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're taking someone with you
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.81,0:37:59.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你让他这么做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You talked him into it
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.20,0:38:00.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,干得漂亮啊 麦坤先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Way to go Mr. McQueen
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.66,0:38:05.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 酷姐 - 你那嘴能把死人说活了\N{\fnArial\fs30}-  Cruz! -  You could talk a snowmobile into an air conditioner
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.94,0:38:07.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要和我一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going with me
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.06,0:38:08.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有那玩意\N{\fnArial\fs30}with that thing
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.30,0:38:10.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对啊 你还需要我帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you still need my help
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.51,0:38:12.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你就和化石一样脆弱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're brittle like a fossil.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.05,0:38:21.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不需要训练员 酷姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't need a trainer out here Cruz
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.88,0:38:22.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你上了年纪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're old
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.82,0:38:24.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你跌倒在海滩上起不来了怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}what if you have fallen on this beach and can't get up
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.06,0:38:28.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,生活就是海滩 你只能行驶下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, life's a beach and then you drive
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.91,0:38:32.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 太逗了 麦坤 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}-  ha ha McQueen.. -  Thank you
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.66,0:38:34.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真美啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is beautiful
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.16,0:38:37.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我明白为什么斯特林先生说你想在这训练了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can see why Mr. Sterling said you wanted to train out here
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.72,0:38:39.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这玩意一启动\N{\fnArial\fs30}As soon as this thing's booted up, we'll get
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.52,0:38:41.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就可以把你放上去 测你的速度\N{\fnArial\fs30}you on the treadmill and I'll track your speed
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.41,0:38:45.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么 不要 来这里就是为了让我的轮胎能放肆奔跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}What! No! The whole idea is getting my tires dirty.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.62,0:38:49.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真正的跑 不是在那玩意上不接触沙子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Real racing not driving on that thing when I've got the sand
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.29,0:38:50.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不接触大地的跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the whole earth
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.88,0:38:55.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 好吧 - 路易吉 就这么做吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}-  Oh, okay. -  Luigi, let's do this
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.53,0:38:58.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎我们的赛车手来到火球海滩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome a racer to fireball beach
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.54,0:39:02.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今天的测速极具历史意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}historical for today's great test of speed
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.21,0:39:06.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们的重点就是远处那看不到的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our finish line will be the abandoned appear in the distance
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.14,0:39:11.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 比快更快 我就是速度的化身\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, quicker than quick faster than fast, I am speed
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.61,0:39:14.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,自我激励的方法很棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is great self- motivation
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.06,0:39:16.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你自己想到的吗 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}-  Did you come up with that? -  Yeah I did
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.34,0:39:19.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,各就各位 预备 跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}On your mark, get set! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.43,0:39:34.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是这样 感觉真爽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here you go, felt good
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.10,0:39:38.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我的速度是多少 - 不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}-  Hey, what was my speed -  I don't know
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.80,0:39:40.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你只有在踏车上我才能测你的速度\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can only track you on the treadmill
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.53,0:39:41.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要踏车\N{\fnArial\fs30}No treadmills.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.28,0:39:44.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 汉密尔顿怎么样 - 汉密尔顿在此\N{\fnArial\fs30}-  Oh, what about Hamilton -  Hamilton here
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.68,0:39:45.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谁是汉密尔顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's Hamilton
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.67,0:39:49.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的电子个人助手 就像你手机上的一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}My electronic personal assistant you know like on your phone
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.71,0:39:51.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你有手机的 有吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do have a phone, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.62,0:39:53.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,赛车是没有手机的 酷姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Race cars don't have phones Cruz
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.02,0:39:56.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,汉密尔顿 跟踪记录麦坤的速度并汇报\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hamilton! Track Mr. McQueen's speed and report it
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.85,0:39:59.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 追踪 - 我会尽可能近的跟着你\N{\fnArial\fs30}-  Tracking -  I'll stay as close as I can
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.33,0:40:01.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的车身会将你的速度传给汉密尔顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your suit will transmit your speeds to Hamilton
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.45,0:40:02.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 无所谓了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine whatever
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.66,0:40:07.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,比快更快 我就是速度的化身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quicker than quick, faster than fast I am speed,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.99,0:40:09.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 好了 路易吉 - 各就位\N{\fnArial\fs30}-  Come on Luigi. -  On your Mark
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.39,0:40:11.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,预备 跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get set and go
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.87,0:40:13.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,每小时46英里\N{\fnArial\fs30}46 mile per hour
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.92,0:40:17.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,53英里 超出测量范围 超出范围\N{\fnArial\fs30}53 miles.. Out of range out of range. Out of range
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.13,0:40:20.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's odd...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.22,0:40:22.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我走不动\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did not go
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.14,0:40:25.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在沙滩上你得慢慢来\N{\fnArial\fs30}On sands you gotta ease into
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.81,0:40:28.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 点火 轮胎可以抓地 懂了吗 - 明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}-  your start or your tires can grab okay? -  okay
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.41,0:40:30.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你每天都和赛车在一起的 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do work with race cars don't you
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.55,0:40:32.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 但从没来过外面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah but never outside
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.60,0:40:34.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 再来一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right let's go again go
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.79,0:40:38.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 每小时54英里 - 就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}-  54 miles per hour -  Here you go
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.22,0:40:40.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,每小时75英里\N{\fnArial\fs30}75 miles per hour
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.57,0:40:44.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,超出范围 超出范围 超出范围\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out of range. Out of range Out of range
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.69,0:40:45.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry
