Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.14,0:50:20.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别说了 别说了 科鲁兹\N{\fnArial\fs30}stop! Just stop! Okay, Cruz
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.23,0:50:22.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你根本不明白 一点都不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't even know you don't even have one clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.78,0:50:23.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是想...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! I was just trying to...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.31,0:50:26.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道如果我这场输了 会怎么样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know what happens if I lose this race
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.07,0:50:31.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这场旅程都是为了能让我快过杰克逊风暴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every mile of this trip was to get me faster than Jackson Storm
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.32,0:50:32.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,比他更快\N{\fnArial\fs30}faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.87,0:50:35.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我开始在模拟器上一点感觉都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I start off getting nowhere for a week on a simulator
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.71,0:50:37.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,又在火球海滩和你浪费了一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lose a whole day with you on Fireball Beach
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.77,0:50:41.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今晚又浪费了 然后被弗里特小姐盯上\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then I waste tonight and then a crosshairs for Miss Fritter
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.79,0:50:44.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我一个月前就卡在这个速度上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm stuck in the same speed I was a month ago
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.14,0:50:45.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一点进步都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't get any faster
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.57,0:50:48.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我忙着照顾训练我的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}because I'm too busy taking care of my trainer
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.97,0:50:51.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是我最后的机会 科鲁兹\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my last chance Cruz
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.92,0:50:57.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最后最终最后一次 如果我输了 就再没机会了\N{\fnArial\fs30}last final finito. If I lose, I never get to do this again
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.45,0:50:58.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你是赛车\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you were a racer you'd
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.86,0:51:01.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你会明白我的话 但你不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}know what I'm talking about but you're not
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.23,0:51:02.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以你不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}so you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.68,0:51:10.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,麦大叔 停车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mack! Pull over!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.15,0:51:12.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在 马上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now! Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.19,0:51:16.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 好吧 停车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay okay pulling over pulling over
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.52,0:51:24.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,问我有没有梦想着做麦坤的训练师\N{\fnArial\fs30}ask me if I dreamed of being a trainer Mr. McQueen go ahead
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.14,0:51:28.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快问我有没有在上学前\N{\fnArial\fs30}ask me if I got up in the
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.02,0:51:31.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,每天在黑夜中跑圈\N{\fnArial\fs30}dark to run laps before school every day
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.24,0:51:32.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,问我有没有省吃俭用\N{\fnArial\fs30}ask me if I saved every penny
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.89,0:51:35.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,攒钱去买他们赛车比赛的门票\N{\fnArial\fs30}to buy a ticket to the races when they came to town
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.14,0:51:40.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,问我有没有那样做 好有一天成为一名训练师\N{\fnArial\fs30}ask me if I did that so that I could be a trainer someday ask me.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.63,0:51:42.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.56,0:51:46.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想永远成为一名训练师\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted to become a racer forever
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.32,0:51:48.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为你\N{\fnArial\fs30}because of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.06,0:51:55.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我过去常常看电视上的你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I used to watch you on TV
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.02,0:51:57.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,飞跃苍穹\N{\fnArial\fs30}flying in the air
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.28,0:52:00.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看上去那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}you seemed so
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.44,0:52:02.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,无所畏惧\N{\fnArial\fs30}fearless
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.93,0:52:07.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,梦想别那么远大 科鲁兹\N{\fnArial\fs30}dream small Cruz
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.82,0:52:09.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我家人过去常常这样说\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's what my family used to say
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.01,0:52:12.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,梦想低调点 或者不去梦想\N{\fnArial\fs30}dream small or not at all
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.06,0:52:16.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们只是想保护我\N{\fnArial\fs30}they were just trying to protect me
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.04,0:52:20.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我是镇上最快的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I was the fastest kid
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.09,0:52:23.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我本打算向他们证明他们错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}in town and I was gonna prove them wrong
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.42,0:52:26.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.67,0:52:29.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当我第一次参加比赛时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I got to my first race.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.28,0:52:31.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我搞明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I figured it out
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.67,0:52:33.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}what
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.27,0:52:37.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,自己并不属于那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I didn't belong
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.08,0:52:41.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其他赛车看上去和我完全不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}the other Racers look nothing like me
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.55,0:52:48.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们更大 更强壮 器宇轩昂\N{\fnArial\fs30}they were bigger and stronger and so confident
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.23,0:52:52.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们点燃引擎时\N{\fnArial\fs30}and when they started their engines
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.91,0:52:54.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}that was it.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.41,0:52:57.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道自己永远成不了赛车\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew I'd never be a racer.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.61,0:53:01.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就离开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just left
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.41,0:53:04.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是我唯一一次机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}it was my one shot
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.49,0:53:07.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没把握住\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I didn't take it
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.17,0:53:14.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}yeah so uh
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.46,0:53:17.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我这就回训练中心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna head back to the training center
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.38,0:53:20.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你我都清楚这样最好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we both know it's for the best
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.48,0:53:25.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我能问你一件事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}but can I ask you something
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.04,0:53:28.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是什么感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}what was it like for you
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.62,0:53:31.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当你第一次参加比赛时\N{\fnArial\fs30}when you showed up to your first race
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.77,0:53:34.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么知道自己能做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}how did you know you could do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.64,0:53:40.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道 我只是从来没想过做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, I just never thought I couldn't
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.43,0:53:45.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那种感觉一定很不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}it was shiny with that felt like
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.28,0:53:49.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,祝你好运 麦坤先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}good luck Mr. McQueen
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.00,0:53:52.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,科鲁兹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cruz
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.65,0:53:55.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,科鲁兹 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cruz, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.59,0:54:18.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,连胜将军 路霸点评\N{\fnArial\fs30}Champion for the ages , Chick Hicks here
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.64,0:54:20.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在路霸工作室为你现场直播\N{\fnArial\fs30}coming to you live from Chick Hicks studios
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.91,0:54:22.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今天我们又请到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}where I'm joined once again
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.38,0:54:24.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,新生代赛车专家 娜塔莉·瑟特恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}by next- gen racing expert, Natalie Certain
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.69,0:54:27.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢了 路霸 活塞杯冠军杰克逊风暴\N{\fnArial\fs30}thanks Chick, Piston Cup champion Jackson Storm
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.00,0:54:29.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今天创造了新纪录\N{\fnArial\fs30}set a new record today when
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.47,0:54:31.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他打破了现存的最快圈速\N{\fnArial\fs30}he pulled off the fastest lap ever recorded.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.85,0:54:36.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,前所未有的每小时213英里\N{\fnArial\fs30}an unprecedented 213 miles an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.22,0:54:38.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么想 瑟特恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}so what do you think Certain.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.49,0:54:40.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,风暴男孩将以又一冠军开启新赛季\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stormy boy gonna start the season with another win.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.95,0:54:42.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很有可能 路霸\N{\fnArial\fs30}highly likely Chick.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.28,0:54:43.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,根据他的近期速度\N{\fnArial\fs30}Based on his recent run times
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.72,0:54:46.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,以及赛车日的预测跟踪温度\N{\fnArial\fs30}and forecasted track temperatures on race day.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.05,0:54:50.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,风暴赢的概率为95.2％\N{\fnArial\fs30}Storms chances of winning are 95.2%.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.16,0:54:51.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那么低吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That low huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.55,0:54:53.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也许你没注意到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh and in case you missed it
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.52,0:54:55.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今晚的赛道论点是闪电麦坤\N{\fnArial\fs30}talk of the track tonight is Lightning McQueen finding
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.89,0:54:58.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,另一种使自己难堪的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}yet another way to embarrass himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.32,0:55:00.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,撞车大赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}at a demolition derby whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.97,0:55:03.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我差点要为他感到抱歉了 并不\N{\fnArial\fs30}almost makes me feel sorry for the guy. not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.18,0:55:06.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他的新赞助商会这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}here's what his new sponsor had to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.12,0:55:08.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大家放松 95会参加比赛的\N{\fnArial\fs30}everyone relax, the 95 is gonna race.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.51,0:55:12.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,闪电选了条不寻常的路来参加竞赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lightnings just taking a somewhat unconventional approach to this race.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.59,0:55:14.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这也是他的粉丝爱他的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's one of the things his fans love about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.81,0:55:17.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 他真是丢脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}huh yeah right. talk about humiliating.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.31,0:55:20.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我甚至懒得去佛罗里达露面\N{\fnArial\fs30}ahow, I won't even bother to show up in Florida.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.43,0:55:21.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也许这样最好 路霸\N{\fnArial\fs30}that could be for the best Chick.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.93,0:55:23.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,即使他参加比赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}even if he does race.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.68,0:55:27.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,麦坤赢的几率也只有1.2％\N{\fnArial\fs30}McQueen's probability of winning is 1.2 percent.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.44,0:55:31.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,数字不会说谎 我今晚作出预测\N{\fnArial\fs30}Numbers never lie. I'm willing to predict tonight
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.60,0:55:36.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,闪电麦坤的赛车事业一周内就会结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}that Lightning McQueen's racing career will be over within the week.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.75,0:55:38.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,甚至可能现在就结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}it might even be over now.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.65,0:55:41.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我早就知道他的事业卡在了...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean I knew his career was stuck in the...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.47,0:55:58.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}what's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.29,0:56:02.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 有人打断了天才\N{\fnArial\fs30}there we go, somebody's interrupting genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.05,0:56:04.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你好 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}well, hey there buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.04,0:56:05.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,板牙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mater!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.80,0:56:07.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我刚刚还在念叨你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I was just thinking
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.29,0:56:09.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这会你就看着我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}of you and here you are looking right at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.79,0:56:10.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你能看见我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}you see me okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.31,0:56:15.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等一下 让我看看 好点了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}wait a second, let me see here. Is that better?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.21,0:56:18.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,直接看进了你的眼睛里 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looking you straight in the eye there pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.55,0:56:21.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉这么晚打给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}hey sorry about calling so late.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.53,0:56:22.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对我来说可不算晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}not for me it's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.52,0:56:24.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可是只夜猫子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm always burning that midnight oil.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.99,0:56:27.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,和我说说最近发生了什么吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}so get me caught up on everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.25,0:56:30.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其实我挺想听听家里发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}well, actually I am kind hope I might hear what's going on back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.73,0:56:33.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没发生什么 如果不算你\N{\fnArial\fs30}well, not much but if you don't count.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.04,0:56:37.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,辉哥想运营轮胎店 告诉路易吉不用担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sergeant Fillmore trying to run the tire shop but tell Luigi not to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.87,0:56:39.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,辉哥会找到每个轮胎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sergeant's gonna track down
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.61,0:56:42.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,即使是被送走的那些\N{\fnArial\fs30}every last tired it fell more done give away.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.49,0:56:44.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,除此以外一切安好\N{\fnArial\fs30}other than that everything's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.32,0:56:47.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 莎莉怎么样 - 她挺好的 在旅馆忙着呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}-  how is Sally? -  oh she's fine, keepin' busy at the cone.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.81,0:56:48.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她很想你\N{\fnArial\fs30}She misses you.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.36,0:56:51.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你上路时 我们都很想你\N{\fnArial\fs30}well shoot, we all do when you're on the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.72,0:56:58.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,实际上 我最近一直在想\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I've been kind of thinking about that you know what
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.56,0:57:00.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不上路时 我们能干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}what we should do when I'm not on the road anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.10,0:57:03.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说不上路是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}what do you mean not on the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.35,0:57:05.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你也知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.80,0:57:08.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,板牙 我不可能永远干这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mater I can't do this forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.35,0:57:14.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的培训没有任何进展\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just not getting anywhere with the training.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.85,0:57:17.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,非要说的话 我也是更慢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}if anything I've gotten slower not faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.17,0:57:19.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,兄弟 这会好起来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}shoot, buddy it'll work out.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.33,0:57:20.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我问题是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just tell me what your problem is
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.65,0:57:23.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会陪着你 直到解决问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'll stay right her with you till we fix it
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.41,0:57:25.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,问题是 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's just it Mater... I don't know,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.85,0:57:29.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我感觉头脑一片空白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel like I'm all out of ideas.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.27,0:57:31.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 让我想想\N{\fnArial\fs30}all right, let me think.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.03,0:57:34.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你知道我怎么办吗 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}-  oh, you know what I'd do? -  What?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.67,0:57:38.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道 我没办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. I got nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.03,0:57:41.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,遇到这些问题时 我也不是博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess I ain't Doc when it comes to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.30,0:57:45.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要是能和他谈谈 我愿付出一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would give anything to talk to him right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.68,0:57:48.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然而再也没有比博士更聪明的人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}yep there was nobody smarter than old Doc.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.31,0:57:50.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也许除了教了他的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}well except for maybe whoever taught him.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.57,0:57:52.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.54,0:57:54.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是说谁都有老师 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean everybody was taught by somebody right.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.06,0:57:56.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拿我表亲多特来说\N{\fnArial\fs30}take my cousin dort.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.28,0:57:59.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他教了我如何同时唱歌吹口哨\N{\fnArial\fs30}he taught me how to sing and whistled at the same time.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.15,0:58:00.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他在那方面非常有音乐天赋\N{\fnArial\fs30}he was very musical that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.82,0:58:01.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,斯莫基\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smokey.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.29,0:58:05.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,板牙 你太聪明了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mater! You're brilliant!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.36,0:58:07.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,秘诀就在于牙齿的形状\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh well..It's all about shape of your teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.38,0:58:08.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我得去托马斯维尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta go to thomasville.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.77,0:58:10.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的 你知道我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh well good. you know me buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.98,0:58:12.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很愿意帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm always happy to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.58,0:58:15.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对大多数车来说 我都是个更好的父亲...\N{\fnArial\fs30}think I'm better dad to most folks, you know talk...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.31,0:58:33.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,酷姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}hey Cruz.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.88,0:58:36.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你无法劝我放弃的 麦坤先生 我要回去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you won't talk me out of this. Mr. McQueen. I'm going back.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.82,0:58:38.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不做你的助理教练了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I resign as your trainer.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.09,0:58:42.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的 我接受你的辞职 再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, I accept your resignation, bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.63,0:58:45.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.11,0:58:48.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过既然你没什么安排了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But since you cleared your calendar,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.85,0:58:50.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,干嘛不跟我们一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}why don't you come with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.64,0:58:52.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在找一个叫斯莫基的车\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm looking for someone named Smokey.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.67,0:58:54.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,希望他能帮助我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hoping he can help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.47,0:58:57.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 或许他也能帮到你 - 不必\N{\fnArial\fs30}-  Maybe he can help you too! -  Nah.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.37,0:59:00.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托 我修好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, I fixed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.01,0:59:04.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢了 不过我就不必了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, thanks anyways, but but I'm done.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.57,0:59:09.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但或许这个会让你改变主意 音乐起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, but maybe this will change your mind, hit it.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.35,0:59:13.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让我来舒展舒展这把老骨头\N{\fnArial\fs30}First I'm gonna loosen up these ancient joints.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.08,0:59:14.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, please don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.52,0:59:18.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很抱歉 很抱歉我冲你吼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry I'm sorry I'm sorry that I yelled
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.34,0:59:21.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我差点被害死不是你的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't your fault that I almost got killed
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.52,0:59:22.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,住嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.62,0:59:25.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但现在你要离开不跟我们一起走\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now you're leaving and you won't get on the ramp
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.18,0:59:27.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我去好了吧 别唱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right I will go, just stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.29,0:59:35.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么知道斯莫基会来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know Smokey is gonna be here?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.27,0:59:36.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.91,0:59:40.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那你知道不知道他是否还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know if he's even alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.73,0:59:43.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 不知道 - 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}-  Nope. -  Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.74,0:59:45.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那你告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}So tell me this.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.83,0:59:47.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你如何知道是斯莫基\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know if it's Smokey...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.16,0:59:49.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等 麦大叔 停车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, Mack, pull over.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.91,0:59:51.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,后退一点 后退点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back it up, back it up!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.71,1:00:07.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(托马斯维尔赛道 51年冠军超凡哈德森大黄蜂之乡)
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.53,1:00:10.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,见到你真好 博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good to see you, Doc.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.51,1:00:13.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那不是你以前的队长吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, isn't that your old crew chief?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.10,1:00:16.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,科鲁兹 你想不想去看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey Cruz, do you want to check out
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.48,1:00:20.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,史上最棒赛车的家乡赛道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}out the home track of the greatest racer ever?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.79,1:00:24.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不是要找斯莫基吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aren't we supposed to be looking for Smokey?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.53,1:00:27.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对了 他已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh that's right, he is dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.32,1:00:29.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这可说不准\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't know that.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.94,1:00:39.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你确定还有时间干这个吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure you have time for this?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.60,1:00:42.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个我确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}For this, I do.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.24,1:00:51.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(托马斯维尔)
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.75,1:00:55.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(活塞杯)
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.40,1:00:59.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(斯莫基车库)
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.62,1:01:04.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个赛道要是会说话就好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow, if this track could talk.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.01,1:01:11.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,科鲁兹 怎么样 来一圈吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cruz, what do you say, let's take a lap.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.77,1:01:39.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太棒了 你做的很棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, you nailed it.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.12,1:01:42.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有死亡校车想害我们 还是很容易的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Way easy without the school bus of death trying to kill us.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.69,1:01:44.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, no kidding.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.33,1:02:03.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得我从未见过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've started to think I might never meet you.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.89,1:02:05.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,斯莫基\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smokey!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.12,1:02:12.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 他还活着 - 我知道你为何来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}-  He is alive. -  I know why you're here.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.37,1:02:15.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你渴了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're thirsty.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.72,1:02:20.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这么跟你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell you what
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.96,1:02:23.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,见到蓝天家的人他们会开心死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}these folks are gonna get a kick out meeting Hud's boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.02,1:02:28.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谁是蓝天？ 哦 蓝天博士 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's Hud? Oh, Doc Hudson, right.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.70,1:02:31.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.07,1:02:35.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,表现好点 有人来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Act civilized, we got company.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.54,1:02:40.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,帅哥 欢迎来到托马斯维尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey sugar, welcome to Thomasville.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.54,1:02:44.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你看到那边了吗 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}-  Would you look at that? -  What?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.82,1:02:47.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,三大赛车传说在那里谈笑风生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three of the biggest racing legends ever
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.21,1:02:49.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,朱尼尔·午夜月 里弗·斯考特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jr. Midnight Moon, River Scott,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.83,1:02:52.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,路易丝·暴风·纳什 她赢过38次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Louise Stormer Nash, she had 38 wins.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.11,1:02:56.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我居然亲眼得见 这不是闪电麦坤吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well as I live and breathe if it ain't Lightning McQueen.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.16,1:02:58.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,纳什小姐 很高兴见到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss Nash it's a pleasure to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.98,1:03:00.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你这一年过得不好 对不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had a tough year haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.70,1:03:04.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你现在不应该在弗罗里达比赛吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shouldn't you be running practice laps in Florida by now?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.71,1:03:07.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 没错 但是 - 你来这窃听秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}-  Yeah sure bu... -  You're here to steal our secrets.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.64,1:03:09.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,寻找丢失的运气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looking for you lost mojo.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.47,1:03:12.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们这里说话真直接 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow, you don't mince words around here, do you?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.44,1:03:15.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说真话总是更直接 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Truth is always quicker, kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.26,1:03:38.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她真是天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's an angle.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.98,1:03:41.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,虽然不想承认\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't wanna admit this,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.50,1:03:45.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但她之前很爱蓝天\N{\fnArial\fs30}but she used to have serious eyes for Hud.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.24,1:03:48.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 是吗 - 就算是也没什么两样\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, really? -  Even if I did it wouldn't have mattered.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.69,1:03:51.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,蓝天不喜欢快的女人 所以我就出局了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hud didn't like fast women and that left me out.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.55,1:03:55.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 路不仅仅是快 她很无畏\N{\fnArial\fs30}No Lou wasn't just fast, she was fearless.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.42,1:03:58.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,第一次看到机会我就知道自己必须参加\N{\fnArial\fs30}The second I saw my first race I just knew I had to get in there.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.82,1:04:01.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然 当时的负责人不希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course the fellas in charge didn't like the idea
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.39,1:04:03.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,女性赛车在赛道上出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}of a lady racer showing them up,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.31,1:04:05.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以就不给我参赛编号\N{\fnArial\fs30}so they wouldn't let me have a number.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.44,1:04:06.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you do?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.49,1:04:08.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我偷了一个 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}-  I stole one.. -  What!!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.96,1:04:11.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还是无法接受拒绝的答案 对吧里弗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I still short to take no for an answer, right River?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.54,1:04:15.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果等邀请那我们可能永无比赛的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we waited for an invitation, we might have never raced.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.47,1:04:18.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一上了赛道 我们就再也不想离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}And once we got on the track, we didn't want to leave.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.13,1:04:19.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,蓝天博士这是这样想\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's how Doc felt too.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.75,1:04:22.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你该见见他当年刚来的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should have seen him when he first came to town.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.14,1:04:25.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,炫目蓝漆 不是随便的哈德森·大黄蜂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shiny blue paint, not just a Hudson Hornet
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.64,1:04:29.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当时他就叫自己超凡哈德森·大黄蜂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}he was already calling himself the fabulous Hudson Hornet
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.31,1:04:33.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们后来就向他挑战 - 不久以后\N{\fnArial\fs30}-  Did we ever ride him on that. -  Not for long.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.49,1:04:35.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,蓝天是密西西比这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hud was the fastest race of
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.29,1:04:38.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 最快的赛车 - 直到他不再是\N{\fnArial\fs30}-  this side of the Mississippi. -  Until he wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.84,1:04:39.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What!!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.77,1:04:43.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,直到新人出现 一切都变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything changed when the Rookie showed up.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.76,1:04:51.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,蓝天不费吹灰之力就超过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Took Hud all at no time to work
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.70,1:04:54.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,南卡和北卡的最佳赛车\N{\fnArial\fs30}his way through the best Racers in both Carolinas.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.61,1:05:00.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,超越里弗 路甚至是朱尼尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Passed River, passed Lou, even Junior.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.37,1:05:03.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但还要超过那个新人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there was still the rookie to deal with.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.46,1:05:08.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他试着把他撞到墙上\N{\fnArial\fs30}He tried slamming him into the wall,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.78,1:05:14.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但如果不想 蓝天绝不会碰到墙\N{\fnArial\fs30}but Hud never touched any wall unless he wanted to.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.87,1:05:28.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个新人可没见过这样的绝技\N{\fnArial\fs30}That rookie never saw anything like that before.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.54,1:05:30.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 博士这么棒 - 开玩笑吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}-  Doc did that!! -  Oh are you kidding?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.82,1:05:34.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他为此可是得意了一周\N{\fnArial\fs30}Couldn't wipe the smile off his face for a week after that.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.13,1:05:38.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真希望见过当时的他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish I could have seen him like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.05,1:05:40.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like what?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.22,1:05:42.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那么开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}So happy.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.26,1:05:52.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你可不是来加油的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't come all this way for a quart of oil, did you?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.56,1:05:55.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,斯莫基 我需要你的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need your help Smokey.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.03,1:05:58.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么样的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, what kind of help?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.83,1:06:02.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还不确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's just it, I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.14,1:06:07.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只知道如果输了弗罗里达的比赛就完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I know is if I lose in Florida, it's it's over for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.26,1:06:10.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,发生在博士身上的也同样会发生在我身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}what happened to Doc will happen to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.45,1:06:13.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did happen to him?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.84,1:06:21.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,赛车是他一生中最美好的 结束赛车生涯时\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, racing was the best part of his life and when it ended he...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.79,1:06:25.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们都清楚从那时起那就变了个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We both know he was never the same after that.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.27,1:06:27.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你想的就是这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that what you think?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.09,1:06:32.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来 我给你看点东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, I want to show you something.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.49,1:06:40.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,前半部分你说对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got the first part right.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.17,1:06:45.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,撞车伤了哈德的身体 不能再赛车伤了他的心\N{\fnArial\fs30}The crash broke Hud's body and the no more racing broke his heart.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.47,1:06:49.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他把自己隔绝了起来 来到了水箱温泉镇\N{\fnArial\fs30}He cut himself off, disappeared to radiator Springs.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.13,1:06:53.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个王八蛋50年没跟我说过话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son- of- a- gun didn't talk to me for 50 years.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.83,1:06:58.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,终于有一天他开始说话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then one day the letters started coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.78,1:07:13.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,张口闭口都是在说你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And every last one of them was about you.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.31,1:07:21.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哈德喜欢赛车 但是给你当教练\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, Hud loved racing but coaching you...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.10,1:07:25.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就没见这个老家伙这么开心过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had never seen the old grump so happy.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.64,1:07:31.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,赛车并不是哈德一生中最美好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Racing wasn't the best part of Hud's life,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.91,1:07:34.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你才是\N{\fnArial\fs30}you were.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.85,1:07:41.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 准备好出去透透气了吗 - 准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}-  Ready to go out for little carbon air, boy? -  Yes, I am.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.27,1:07:47.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,油门踩太猛都快开到郁金香里去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give it too much travel you in the tulip.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.28,1:07:51.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,闪电 这个你可能会想要记录一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}hey, Lightning you might want to take notes on this one.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.19,1:08:06.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你很有天赋 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got a lot of stuff, kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.80,1:08:26.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哈德在你身上看到了你自己都没看到的闪光点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hud saw something in you that you don't even see in yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.72,1:08:31.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你准备好去认识自己了吗 - 准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}-  Are you ready to go find it? -  Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.44,1:08:42.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.81,1:08:49.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 第一课 你老了 承认吧 - 我跟他说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}-  Lesson one: You're old. Accept it. -  I told him that.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.00,1:08:52.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他可能耳朵不大好使了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is probably losing his hearing.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.19,1:08:54.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 他说你老了 - 我听见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}-  He said you're old. -  I heard him.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.24,1:08:56.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你永远都不会像风暴一样快\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll never be as fast as Storm,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.75,1:08:58.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是你可以比他更聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you can be smarter than him.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.12,1:09:01.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好 我该怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, what do I do?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.01,1:09:03.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说你参加了德贝冲撞大赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said you were in a demolition derby..
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.28,1:09:05.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 是的 特别恐怖 - 你确定吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}-  Yeah , it was terrible. -  Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.84,1:09:07.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你身上连一道刮伤都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause there's not a scratch on you.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.28,1:09:13.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当一个赛车手没想太多的时候能做到什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Funny what a racer can do when he's not overthinking things.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.78,1:09:17.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这里是佛罗里达国际大赛 我是主持人香农\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shannon spokes here at Florida international
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.26,1:09:22.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,杰克逊·风暴今天的竞赛速度达到了214迈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jackson Storm clocked 214 miles per hour today.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.65,1:09:30.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要想打败风暴 你需要一个替身\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to beat the Storm, you need someone to stand in for,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.66,1:09:32.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就像陪练似的\N{\fnArial\fs30}like a sparring partner.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.52,1:09:35.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不太确定 我不是赛车手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not so sure. I not a racer,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.25,1:09:37.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我就是个训练员 - 加油 证明自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}-  just a trainer. -  Go ahead and gun it
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.74,1:09:46.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不加消音器的话 你连声音都像风暴\N{\fnArial\fs30}With no muffler, you even sound like Storm.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.88,1:09:48.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要不行了 麦坤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you're going down McQueen.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.20,1:09:51.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把那个关节炎铁路行李箱放铁轨上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get that arthritis rail keister onto the tracks, so I can
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.69,1:09:54.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这样我就能把这帮老家伙打发回去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}put you into the old folks home against your will.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.03,1:09:57.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is that?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.76,1:09:59.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 挺好使 - 对我是好使\N{\fnArial\fs30}-  That will work. -  Work for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.43,1:10:01.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我就不用了 - 是 挺好使的\N{\fnArial\fs30}-  I'm good. -  Yeah, that will do.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.12,1:10:02.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她刚才说什么...\N{\fnArial\fs30}What ever she says...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.54,1:10:06.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,佛罗里达进行资格审查的时候你没来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't show up in Florida for qualifying,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.35,1:10:08.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以你只能最后出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}so you'll be starting dead last.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.51,1:10:10.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我给你三圈的机会超过她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll give you three laps to catch her
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.80,1:10:13.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,整场就跑三圈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go through the entire field in three laps!!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.54,1:10:16.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你到底想不想打败风暴 - 当然想\N{\fnArial\fs30}-  You wanna beat Storm or not? -  Yes, of course I do
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.71,1:10:18.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那就出发吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then go!!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.59,1:10:21.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,加油 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, kid
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.55,1:10:35.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 看来我们有活干了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, looks like we got some work to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.73,1:10:40.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快点 条件反射是第一个要过关的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look alive. Reflexes are the first thing to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.40,1:10:46.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们为什么在赛场里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are we in a field?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.52,1:10:49.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,从窗口穿过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sneak through that window.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.33,1:10:51.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 什么意思 - 我也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}-  What is that mean? -  I don't know!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.22,1:10:52.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.71,1:11:03.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一点都不好玩 不好玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not cool man, not cool.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.23,1:11:09.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,回来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's roll it back.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.90,1:11:14.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还想不想离开这了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you even want to be out here?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.54,1:11:19.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就剩两天了 我们得加把劲了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only two days left, yet we gotta work harder.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.53,1:11:24.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,搞什么 那是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell, who is that?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.97,1:11:27.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我把麦坤加里了 给你点真正的竞争\N{\fnArial\fs30}I put McQueen in there to give you some real competition.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.53,1:11:35.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哈德是能让其他车为他效劳的大师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hud was a master of letting the other cars do the work for him
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.23,1:11:36.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他以前常说 跟他打比赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}He used to say, playing to him
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.72,1:11:39.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就仿佛你们是夏夜里的两只六月虫\N{\fnArial\fs30}is like you were two June bugs on a summer night
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.12,1:11:40.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他那招是偷了我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He stole that from me.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.09,1:11:43.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,漂移？我从来不需要用那招\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drafting? I've never had to do that.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.77,1:11:46.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错 那是因为当年你很快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's when you were fast,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.82,1:11:50.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 现在你又慢 - 又老 - 还晃晃悠悠的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Now you're slow... - And old... - And rickety...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.08,1:11:51.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 好了 我知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, okay, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.64,1:11:53.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,新的你要寻找\N{\fnArial\fs30}The new you has to look
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.22,1:11:56.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那些你未曾意识到的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}for opportunities you never knew were there.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.96,1:12:00.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,从窗口穿过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sneak through the window.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.55,1:12:05.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 从窗口穿过去 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}-  Sneak through the window. -  What?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.07,1:12:07.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有窗户打开的话 抓住机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}When a window opens take it.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.97,1:12:20.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I made it.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.41,1:12:24.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来吧 动起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go, let's move.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.44,1:12:26.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,条件反射\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reflexes!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.34,1:12:30.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 吉多 来点真家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alright Guido, turn up the heat.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.31,1:12:40.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看看谁终于现身了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alright, look who finally showed up.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.95,1:12:47.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 这就是我们磨赛车牙的地方 - 在森林里\N{\fnArial\fs30}-  This is where we cut our racing teeth. -  In the woods?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.64,1:12:51.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们还是说月亮一直照耀着我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's just say the moon was always shining on us.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.61,1:12:55.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果没有月光照耀的话 我们就不用\N{\fnArial\fs30}If the moon didn't shine we didn't have to...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.71,1:12:56.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,算了不说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, nevermind
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.55,1:12:59.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们追着月光跑 傻瓜\N{\fnArial\fs30}We ran moonshine, dummy!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.57,1:13:03.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有 不开大灯 全凭直觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the way, no lights. Instinct only.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.09,1:13:54.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,麦坤还没到？当年他还是新手时 不就玩过这招么\N{\fnArial\fs30}McQueen still not here, didn't he pull this when he was a rookie?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.57,1:13:56.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是我爷爷告诉我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my grandfather told me.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.48,1:13:58.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 我们还有时间再跑最后一场\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, we got time for one last race.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.80,1:14:01.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快点 老大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry this along, boss.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.21,1:14:03.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们得把你送到佛罗里达 - 加油\N{\fnArial\fs30}-  We gotta get you to Florida! -  Go!!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.78,1:14:09.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也许最好是他不来参赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it's best that he doesn't show up,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.30,1:14:11.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你也知道上个赛季是什么结果\N{\fnArial\fs30}you know after how last season ended.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.98,1:14:17.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让我这么说好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me put it this way.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.23,1:14:20.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可不想因为想知道麦坤在哪儿而浪费睡眠\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not losing any sleep wondering where Lightning McQueen is!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.49,1:14:27.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,加油 加油\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.28,1:14:38.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you go!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.58,1:14:55.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,麦坤没劲了 麦坤没劲了 麦坤衰退得太快了\N{\fnArial\fs30}McQueen is fading! McQueen is fading! Fading fast!!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.43,1:15:07.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看到吗 真是不可思议\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you see that? That was incredible.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.49,1:15:17.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉 我不是故意要...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, sorry. I didn't mean to...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.25,1:15:25.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老大 该上路了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey boss, it's time to hit the road.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.20,1:15:35.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想感谢各位帮助我训练\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I wanna thank everyone for the training.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.72,1:15:38.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们该去佛罗里达了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We better get going to Florida.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.81,1:15:51.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎参加赛车盛会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to racing's greatest day
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.24,1:15:54.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们在佛罗里达海滨的国际赛车道\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're beachside at the Florida international speedway
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.22,1:15:56.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,宣布新一季的活塞杯比赛开幕\N{\fnArial\fs30}to kick off a new season of Piston Cup racing
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.75,1:15:58.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这里是佛罗里达500\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the Florida 500.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.55,1:16:00.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,43辆汽车在数百万粉丝的期待中\N{\fnArial\fs30}43 cars in a quarter million fans
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.41,1:16:02.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迎来了今天紧张刺激的竞赛 这是战略和技巧的竞赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}await today's intense contest of strategy, skill,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.95,1:16:04.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然更是速度的竞争\N{\fnArial\fs30}but most of all speed.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:04.36,1:16:07.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,盛大的赛车之日就要来临\N{\fnArial\fs30}This crowd is in for one great day of racing.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.24,1:16:08.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是鲍勃·卡特拉斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Bob Cutlass joined as
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.62,1:16:11.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在我身边的仍然是我的广播伙伴达雷尔·车旅\N{\fnArial\fs30}always by my broadcasting partner Darrell Cartrip,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.32,1:16:13.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,以及分析师娜塔莉·瑟特恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}and stat sensation Natalie Certain.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.81,1:16:14.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我从来没见过风暴他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never seen the numbers
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.89,1:16:16.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今天这样的阵势 鲍勃\N{\fnArial\fs30}lineup for Storm like they do today, Bob.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.50,1:16:20.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,风暴获胜的可能性最高有96.8%\N{\fnArial\fs30}Storm should be ninety six point eight percent unstoppable.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.59,1:16:22.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也别小瞧了闪电麦坤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, don't overlook Lightning McQueen.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.15,1:16:24.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,惠普尔过滤器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whipple filter.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.91,1:16:26.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们听到传闻\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've heard stories of
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.17,1:16:28.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,麦坤来这儿前通常会接受训练\N{\fnArial\fs30}the unusual way McQueen trained to get here.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.88,1:16:31.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在的问题是 有没有效果呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now the question is did it work?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.81,1:16:45.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,速度 我就是...速度？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Speed. I am... speed?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.59,1:16:54.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老大 他们叫选手们上赛道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey boss, they are calling the Racers to the track.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.42,1:16:59.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,杰夫·格威特 今天的人才储备怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jeff Gorvette, how does today's talent stack up?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.76,1:17:02.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想我们今天会有好事的 这些选手...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh I think we're in for a treat today. These Racers...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.30,1:17:07.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 麦坤 为我们这些老家伙赢一把 - 会的 杰夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}-  Hey McQueen, win one for us old guys.. -  Will do Jeff...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:08.53,1:17:10.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大家好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.09,1:17:12.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 贴纸 - 莎莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}-  Stickers. -  Hey, Sal,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.22,1:17:14.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你好吗 - 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}-  Are you okay? -  Yeah yeah..
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.78,1:17:15.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,非常好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.08,1:17:18.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着 你今天一定会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, you're gonna do
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.46,1:17:20.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,表现得很棒 不管发生什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}great today. And no matter what happens,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.34,1:17:23.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我都会向下个新人投怀送抱 忘记我认识过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna move on to the next rookie and forget I ever knew you
Dialogue: 0,1:17:25.83,1:17:27.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真高兴你在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm glad you're here.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.30,1:17:32.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,穿得真漂亮 过来一起拍个照\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow, nice costume. Come here. Let's get a picture.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:32.04,1:17:34.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,见到我的头号粉丝真是太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's so great to meet my number one fan.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.03,1:17:36.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真是个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a jerk!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.19,1:17:39.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 她不是粉丝 风暴 - 是你啊 冠军\N{\fnArial\fs30}-  She's not a fan, Storm. -  Oh, hey there champ.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.32,1:17:42.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听说今天之后你就要去卖挡泥板了 真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard you're selling mud flap after today. Is that true?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.53,1:17:45.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要让我做你的第一个客户 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey you put me down for the first case okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.85,1:18:00.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,闪电麦坤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lightning McQueen!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.19,1:18:04.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 闪电 - 斯特林先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}-  Hey Lightning! -  Hey Mr. Sterling!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.74,1:18:09.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 敬未来 如何 冠军 - 好 敬未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}-  To the future. Hey champ? -  Yeah, to the future.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.79,1:18:13.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只要集中精力想你在这里要做什么 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey... just focus on what you're here to do, kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.94,1:18:18.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 谢谢 斯莫基 - 去让哈德骄傲吧 - 没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}-  Thanks Smokey. -  Now, go make Hud proud. -  You got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.08,1:18:31.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,闪电麦坤从比赛开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lightning McQueen is making
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.50,1:18:33.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一直在稳步加速\N{\fnArial\fs30}steady progress in the early parts of this race.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.00,1:18:37.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 这速度赶超风暴可不够 - 既然他一开始是垫底\N{\fnArial\fs30}-  It won't be enough to catch Storm. -  Considered he started dead last,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.56,1:18:39.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想他应该不会再差到哪儿去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think he's doing half bad out there.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.20,1:18:52.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,保持下去也不算太坏 你会进前十名的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not too shabby keep this up, you'll finish in the top ten.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.33,1:18:54.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,前十名可不行 斯莫基\N{\fnArial\fs30}Top ten is not going to cut it, Smokey.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:54.30,1:18:55.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我必须要大获全胜\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to go all the way.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.17,1:18:58.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那就好好回忆你训练时的细节\N{\fnArial\fs30}So dig in remember your training,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.45,1:19:00.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,找到风暴 赶超他\N{\fnArial\fs30}find Storm and chase him down.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.28,1:19:02.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉他 他有三个膝盖可以抓住我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh tell him he has three laps to catch me
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.54,1:19:04.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,科鲁兹说 你有三个膝盖可以抓住她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cruz says you've got three laps to catch her.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.84,1:19:07.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好 替我谢她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Tell her thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.28,1:19:14.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,科鲁兹 你在这干什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cruz, what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.91,1:19:16.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,斯特林先生 我只是在...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh Mr. Sterling, I was just...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.86,1:19:18.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你给我马上回训练中心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would like you to head back to the training center right away,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:18.45,1:19:19.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 可为什么呢 - 我要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}-  Oh! But why? -  I need you to
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.98,1:19:22.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,去让库尔特准备参加下周末的比赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}get Kurt up to speed for the race next weekend.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.15,1:19:26.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不行 不要库尔特 他太烂了 换一个 罗纳德吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, not Kurt. He's the bug guy, right? The other one, Ronald.Yes
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.08,1:19:30.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我想在这儿看比赛 - 这可不行 科鲁兹\N{\fnArial\fs30}-  I want to stay and watch. - That's not gonna happen, Cruz.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.39,1:19:33.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 快走吧 - 可麦坤先生还有机会...\N{\fnArial\fs30}-  Now go. -  But Mr. McQueen still has a chance...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.08,1:19:34.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快去干你的活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just go do your job.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.81,1:19:36.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.96,1:19:39.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把那个扰流板和赛车轮胎拿下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And take off that spoiler and those racing tires.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.45,1:19:40.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看上去真可笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.47,1:19:44.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,记住你是个训练师 不是选手 不是选手\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are a trainer, remember not a racer! Not a racer!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:45.86,1:19:46.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你是选手\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you were racer,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.94,1:19:49.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你就该懂我在说什么 可你不懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'd know what I'm talking about. But you're not.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.89,1:19:51.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以别犯傻了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you don't
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.81,1:19:57.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不不不 她不是选手 她是训练师\N{\fnArial\fs30}No no no, she's not a racer she's a trainer.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.55,1:20:11.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为你 我想成为一名赛车选手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted to become a racer forever, because of you!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.51,1:20:15.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是我唯一的机会 但我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was my one shot and I
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.70,1:20:20.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有抓住 这是我唯一的机会 但我没有抓住\N{\fnArial\fs30}didn't take it. It was my one shot I didn't take it
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.67,1:20:27.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,进入第二圈 进入第二个转弯 坚持 坚持\N{\fnArial\fs30}Break in two! Break in turn two! Hold on! Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.37,1:20:42.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,孩子 你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kid, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:42.96,1:20:45.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 斯莫基 我需要科鲁兹 - 现在别管那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}-  Smokey, I need Cruz. -  Never mind that now.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.46,1:20:48.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 我要她马上回来 让她回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I need her back here now. Get her back
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.84,1:20:51.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,危机仍未解除...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yellow flags still out folks...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:52.01,1:20:54.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哈密尔顿 这有个来自查斯特·增压过滤王的通话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hamilton here call from Chester whipple filter.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.38,1:20:57.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,查斯特 麦坤先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chester! Mr. McQueen!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.68,1:20:59.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,绿灯亮起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well the green lights on
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.17,1:21:01.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,场内赛道开放了 所有车都进来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}pit road is opening and everybody's coming in.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.99,1:21:05.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,准备好各位 路易吉 吉多 轮胎 费尔默 汽油\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get ready guys Luigi, Guido- tire, Fillmore- fuel
Dialogue: 0,1:21:05.40,1:21:07.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我来了 怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I'm here. What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:08.46,1:21:12.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 不 不是我 是她 - 她回来干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}-  No, not me... her! -  What is she doing back there?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:13.02,1:21:16.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 快点 伙计们 快给她装备好 - 等等 怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}-  Come on guys, get her set up quickly. -  Okay, wait! What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:16.81,1:21:20.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 雷蒙 带了画笔吗 - 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}-  Hey Ramone, got your paints? -  You know I do.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:20.24,1:21:22.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等 你们在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait! Guys! What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.48,1:21:23.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man. I don't understand it.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.68,1:21:26.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那里是麦坤的位置 肯定有哪里不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}McQueen's just sat there. Something's got to be wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.39,1:21:28.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 麦坤先生 - 今天是你的好日子 酷姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}-  Mr. McQueen! -  Today's is your day, Cruz
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.55,1:21:29.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你将把握机会 一战成名\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're getting your shot
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.58,1:21:30.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:30.47,1:21:33.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这场比赛由我开跑 也将由你结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}I started this race and you're gonna finish it
Dialogue: 0,1:21:33.21,1:21:37.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么 她会砸了牌子的 她只是个训练生\N{\fnArial\fs30}What! She will damage the brand. She's just a trainer
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.07,1:21:38.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 她是个赛车手\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, she's a racer.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:38.68,1:21:40.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只不过我花了点时间才看出这一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just took me a while to see you.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.50,1:21:41.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这不合法\N{\fnArial\fs30}That can't be legal.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:41.72,1:21:44.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,规则只说了号码不得变更\N{\fnArial\fs30}The rules only said the number has to be out there,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.12,1:21:46.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没说穿戴号码的车不可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}doesn't say who has to wear it.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.23,1:21:46.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不能这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.47,1:21:49.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有告诉过你我有多喜欢你的挡泥板吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, did I ever tell you how much I love your mud flaps?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.93,1:21:50.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别挡路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of my way!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:50.76,1:21:55.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就给自己备了美容挡板 教堂挡板...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I got my the facial flaps, the church flaps...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:57.55,1:22:00.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,加油同志们 我们一定要让她上场 快啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on guys, we gotta get her out there, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.52,1:22:01.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 检查燃料 - 良好\N{\fnArial\fs30}-  Check fuel! -  Checked!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:01.76,1:22:02.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拉蒙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ramone!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.92,1:22:05.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就这么点时间 我尽力了 老大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Best I could do in the time frame boss.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.73,1:22:08.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不错 很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that'll work.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.64,1:22:11.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么要这么做 是你自己说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you doing this! You said it yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.20,1:22:12.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这可能是你最后一次机会了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This might be your last chance.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.19,1:22:17.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也是我最后一次让你崭露头角的机会 酷姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which makes it my last chance to give you your first chance, Cruz.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.45,1:22:20.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这次 我希望你能把握住机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}This time I want you to take it.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:22.52,1:22:24.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她会把那个领头的超过去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's got a beat that pace car out.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:25.22,1:22:27.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不行 不行 你不能这么干\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, you can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.16,1:22:28.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,过了这村儿没这店儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now or never.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.65,1:22:30.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you say
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.11,1:22:36.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 二十五迈的速度比较合适我 - 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}-  25 miles per hour fits me. -  I know that.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.05,1:22:45.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,闪电麦坤的队伍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lightning McQueen's team
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.33,1:22:47.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,换上了另一辆持95号的车\N{\fnArial\fs30}has headed a different car supporting the 95.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:47.76,1:22:49.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真不敢相信我都看到了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't believe what I'm seeing.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.46,1:22:51.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你有在看吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're watching this right?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.12,1:22:52.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么 穿制服的那女的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? the girl in the costume.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.86,1:22:55.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,开玩笑吧 他居然让她上场\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'e kidding me! He put her in the race!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.19,1:23:08.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,比赛继续 我们继续关注\N{\fnArial\fs30}The green flag is out, and we are back to racing.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.13,1:23:15.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,酷姐 你干什么呢 加油 集中精神\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cruz, what are you doing? Come on, pick it up.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.36,1:23:16.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你得再跑快点 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to go faster, okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.03,1:23:18.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,叫她弗朗西斯·安全带\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call her Francis beltline and
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.52,1:23:21.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉他 死亡校车在追她\N{\fnArial\fs30}tell her the the school bus of death is after her.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:21.05,1:23:23.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 什么 我不要 - 相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}-  What! No! -  Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.23,1:23:29.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,弗朗西斯·安全带 死亡校车在后面追你哟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Francis beltline, the school bus of death is after you.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.45,1:23:35.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 什么 好的 - 好吧 这招倒是新鲜\N{\fnArial\fs30}-  What? Oh, right -  Okay, that was different.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:36.76,1:23:39.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,酷姐 你表现得太紧张了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cruz, you are looking too tight now.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:39.28,1:23:40.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乖 放松点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, loosen it up!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.37,1:23:41.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟她说她是一团松软的云\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell her she is a fluffy cloud.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.66,1:23:43.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 什么 才不要 - 斯莫基 快说\N{\fnArial\fs30}-  What! No! -  Smokey, tell her.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:44.82,1:23:49.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,酷姐 你就是一团松软的云\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cruz, you are a fluffy cloud.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:49.74,1:23:51.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的 太紧张\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, right... too tight.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.46,1:23:54.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是松软的云 我是松软的云\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am a fluffy cloud! I am a fluffy cloud!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.97,1:24:00.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你刚进入弯道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just pick the turns.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.76,1:24:02.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,酷姐 心思要放到比赛上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cruz, get your head in the race.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:02.13,1:24:03.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别别别 等下 等下\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, wait, wait, wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.61,1:24:05.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉她她正在海滩上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell her she's on a beach and
Dialogue: 0,1:24:05.10,1:24:07.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所有的出租车都回家过夜了\N{\fnArial\fs30}all the little cabbies have gone night- night.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.52,1:24:11.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要 我才不说 要说你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Ain't saying that. You tell her.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.89,1:24:15.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了酷姐 想想海滩 我让你想想海滩\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, Cruz. The beach, I need you to think of the beach.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.70,1:24:18.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 麦坤先生 - 对对 是我 回想海滩\N{\fnArial\fs30}-  Mr. McQueen! -  Yeah, yeah, it's me. Remember th beach
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.35,1:24:21.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,选好赛道 不要跑偏 懂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, pick a line! Stick to it! I got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.28,1:24:26.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好 还不赖嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, not too bad.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.09,1:24:27.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,实战跟模拟一点都不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is nothing like the simulator.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:28.20,1:24:31.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你需要的一样不缺 想想托马斯维尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got every toy in need. Remember Thomasville.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.45,1:24:33.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 托马斯维尔 - 对 从窗户溜进溜出\N{\fnArial\fs30}-  Thomasville? -  Yeah, sneak through the window.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:33.67,1:24:36.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在我明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now that, I understand
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.38,1:24:37.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,从窗户溜进溜出\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sneak through the window.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.33,1:24:56.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我刚刚得知\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am just learning that
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.82,1:24:59.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,替换麦坤的选手是酷姐拉米雷兹\N{\fnArial\fs30}the racer replacing McQueen is Cruz Ramirez
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.67,1:25:01.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是她的处女赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is her very first race.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:01.32,1:25:02.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其实 达雷尔 资料显示\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, Darrell, it says
Dialogue: 0,1:25:02.78,1:25:05.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她确实有赢过一次比赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}here she does have one win under her belt
Dialogue: 0,1:25:05.21,1:25:07.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,比赛地点叫做雷暴山谷\N{\fnArial\fs30}at a place called Thunder Hollow.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:07.91,1:25:10.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,雷暴山谷 雷暴山谷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thunder Hollow! Thunder hollow!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:15.09,1:25:15.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got it!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:18.19,1:25:19.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,往下 往下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go low! Go low!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.84,1:25:22.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,干得漂亮 这帮人跟你一比逊爆了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice job, you are smoking these guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.77,1:25:25.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在 注意三号发射器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, watch the tire marvel's launcher three.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:25.04,1:25:26.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 保持轮胎整洁 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}-  Keep your tires clean. -  Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:26.56,1:25:28.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,撞击 进入内道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bump, coming up on the inside.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:28.11,1:25:29.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小心 不要飞起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Careful, you don't go airborne.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.77,1:25:30.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 现在吗 - 对 就现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}-  Now? -  Yes. Now!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:31.29,1:25:32.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小心墙边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch out by the wall,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:32.73,1:25:34.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那里有点滑\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's a little slick there.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:34.14,1:25:35.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小心 小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch it! Watch it!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.27,1:25:37.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你上了墙\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have hit a wall.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:37.89,1:25:40.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你刚刚上了墙\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have hit a wall!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.71,1:25:41.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只是燃起了斗志\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just being aggressive.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.73,1:25:48.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 进入检修站 注意转数 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}-  Hey, come on into the pit, watch your RPM. -  Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:48.61,1:25:51.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,放开油门 踩刹车 踩刹车啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get off the gas, on the brake, on the brake!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.08,1:25:51.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太快了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too fast.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.57,1:25:54.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 回来就好 - 抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}-  Oh, we're back here. -  Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.60,1:25:56.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好 超过他们 一个个超车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alright, pick them off, one at a time.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.94,1:25:58.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,上 上 上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:00.27,1:26:02.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就这样 又稳又直\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it! Nice and straight.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.21,1:26:06.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,上啊 上啊 上啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.31,1:26:08.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,斯莫基 你看到没\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smokey, are you watching!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:13.11,1:26:15.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉你一声 拉米雷兹就要追上你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want to let you know, Ramirez is moving up toward you.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:15.99,1:26:19.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我干嘛要关心 - 因为她已经挤进前十了\N{\fnArial\fs30}-  Why should I care? -  Because now she's in the top ten.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:22.51,1:26:25.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在你就要追上领跑的车了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, now you are coming up on the leaders.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.72,1:26:33.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拉米雷兹升至第四\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ramirez up the fourth.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:33.77,1:26:34.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,第四了 呵呵\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fourth! Huh...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:38.04,1:26:39.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,超过他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oo hoo. Get it done...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.90,1:26:44.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拉米雷兹升至第三了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ramirez is in the third.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:51.82,1:26:53.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在干什么 风暴\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing, Storm?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:54.41,1:26:57.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,制服女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, costume girl
Dialogue: 0,1:26:57.10,1:26:59.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一开始我看到你入场比赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're at first I thought you were down here
Dialogue: 0,1:26:59.28,1:26:59.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还以为你是定位坏了迷路了呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}because your GPS was broken.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:59.89,1:27:01.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别听他的 酷姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't listen to him, Cruz.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:01.20,1:27:04.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看上去不错 你知道表面光鲜很重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look good. it's important to look the part.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:04.70,1:27:07.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,总不能让大家觉得你没资格来参赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't have everyone thinking that you don't deserve to be here.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:07.13,1:27:08.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他只是想惹毛你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just trying to get in your head.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:08.43,1:27:11.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,人们不需要知道我和你的出身和经历\N{\fnArial\fs30}They don't need to know what you and I already do.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:11.55,1:27:14.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你想打扮成什么样的赛车都没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}That you can play dress- up all you want,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:15.21,1:27:17.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但你永远也成不了我们这样的赛车手\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you'll never be one of us.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:24.68,1:27:26.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,酷姐 你发现出什么状况了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cruz, did you see what happened there?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:26.52,1:27:30.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 发现了 他...他干扰到我了 - 不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}-  Yeah, he's in... he's in my head. -  No, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:30.20,1:27:33.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听我说 你得去干扰他 明白了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me! You got into his head, don't you understand?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:33.69,1:27:37.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你威胁到他了 所以他才故意损你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He would never have done that if you didn't scare him
Dialogue: 0,1:27:37.70,1:27:41.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 什么 - 他怕你赢 你自己还没意识到吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- what! - He see something in you that you don't even see in yourself
Dialogue: 0,1:27:42.24,1:27:46.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我相信你 你也要相信自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}you made me believe it. now, you gotta believe it too
Dialogue: 0,1:27:47.46,1:27:51.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是赛车 尽情发挥\N{\fnArial\fs30}you are a racer! Use that!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.12,1:28:05.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 她掉哪儿了 - 你屁股后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How far back is she now? - Look behind you!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.59,1:28:07.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 什么 - 晚上好 风暴\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What! - Good evening, Storm!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:07.03,1:28:09.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是挂在你后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am just back here graging on your butt
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.86,1:28:11.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不用担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}nothing to be concerned
Dialogue: 0,1:28:11.43,1:28:14.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就像夏夜的两只金龟子\N{\fnArial\fs30}like two June bugs on a summer night
Dialogue: 0,1:28:17.73,1:28:19.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 汉密尔顿 - 汉密尔顿在\N{\fnArial\fs30}- hey, Hamilton! - Hamilton here!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.85,1:28:24.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 现在时速多少 - 208英里 207英里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How are my speed? - 208 mile per hour, 207 miles per hour.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.63,1:28:29.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 别闹 你把我拽偏了 - 活该 - 加油 科鲁兹\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stop that! You are taking me off the line! - Ah, slap. - Come on, Cruz.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:31.93,1:28:34.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我导航说前方道路堵塞\N{\fnArial\fs30}My GPS say that there's slow travelling in my way
Dialogue: 0,1:28:35.03,1:28:37.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 不 你休想赢\N{\fnArial\fs30}no no no you are not wining it!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:37.40,1:28:40.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你急了 - 我没急\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You are angry! - I am not angry!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:41.18,1:28:44.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你急你倒是冲啊 - 说了我没急\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You can use that anger to push through - I said I'm not angry.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:45.73,1:28:46.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,休想超车\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think so
Dialogue: 0,1:28:52.57,1:28:56.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 科鲁兹 快脱身 - 你不属于这条赛道！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Cruz, get out of there! - You don't belong on this track!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:58.20,1:29:00.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错 我属于！\N{\fnArial\fs30}yes, I do!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:12.54,1:29:15.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,难以置信 酷姐拉米雷兹竟然赢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't believe it! It's Cruz Ramirez for the win
Dialogue: 0,1:29:15.33,1:29:16.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真没想到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't expect this
Dialogue: 0,1:29:22.55,1:29:23.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,酷姐拉米雷兹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cruz Ramirez
Dialogue: 0,1:29:24.66,1:29:26.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,干得漂亮 科鲁兹\N{\fnArial\fs30}way to go, Cruz
Dialogue: 0,1:29:34.68,1:29:37.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,精彩至极的胜利\N{\fnArial\fs30}man, heck of a win!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:38.00,1:29:41.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错 精彩至极\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, heck of a win!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:44.96,1:29:47.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 科鲁兹 你飞起来了 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey Cruz, you were flying! - Thanks
Dialogue: 0,1:29:47.98,1:29:50.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你今天真是超棒超酷 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- you really had it roll today, that was cool - thank you
Dialogue: 0,1:29:50.52,1:29:56.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 科鲁兹 你灯亮了 - 是吗 骗我呢 真是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- hey Cruz, your blinkers are on. - It is? You got me! Very funny
Dialogue: 0,1:30:08.62,1:30:13.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,去吧 燥两圈\N{\fnArial\fs30}go ahead... get them some smoke
Dialogue: 0,1:30:26.99,1:30:28.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你会习惯的\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'll get used to that
Dialogue: 0,1:30:29.18,1:30:30.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让开 快让开\N{\fnArial\fs30}come on, move it! Move!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:31.33,1:30:35.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,科鲁兹 我就知道你有本事 瞧瞧你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cruz, I knew you had something and now look at you
Dialogue: 0,1:30:36.32,1:30:40.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,冠军啊 我可以让你成为队里的赛车 我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}a winner. I could use you as a racer on our team.We...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:40.51,1:30:45.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉 斯特林先生 我不想为你打工 我辞职\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry Mr. Sterling, I would never race for you. I quit
Dialogue: 0,1:30:46.53,1:30:48.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那来我们队吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}well then race for me
Dialogue: 0,1:30:48.21,1:30:49.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 特克斯 - 科鲁兹小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tex, - Miss Cruz I would be
Dialogue: 0,1:30:49.97,1:30:53.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你能来恐龙石油车队 我可要高兴坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}tickled pink to have you race for team Dinoco
Dialogue: 0,1:30:53.18,1:30:56.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们历来有许多优秀赛车\N{\fnArial\fs30}as you know we have a long history of great Racers
Dialogue: 0,1:30:56.41,1:30:59.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 当然除了卡尔 - 呃 伙计们 我还没走人呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Except for the Cal. - Oh guys, I am still right here.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:59.73,1:31:03.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 恐龙石油啊 科鲁兹 - 雇她好了 我不在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Team Dinoco Cruz! - Hire her I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:03.23,1:31:05.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,闪电 既然你退休了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lightning now that you're retired,
Dialogue: 0,1:31:05.04,1:31:07.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,周一大早就过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need your first thing Monday morning
Dialogue: 0,1:31:07.09,1:31:08.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拍照\N{\fnArial\fs30}for a photo shoot
Dialogue: 0,1:31:08.49,1:31:10.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,知道了 斯特林先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}yeah all right Mr. Sterling
Dialogue: 0,1:31:10.31,1:31:12.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}oh, hang on now
Dialogue: 0,1:31:15.39,1:31:17.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么 我名字怎么也跑上面了\N{\fnArial\fs30}what! Why is my name up there!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:17.87,1:31:19.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,比赛是你起头的 规则如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've started the race that's how it works
Dialogue: 0,1:31:19.93,1:31:21.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等 怎么回事 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}wait! What! We will, no!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:21.74,1:31:23.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果闪电麦坤赢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Lightning McQueen wins,
Dialogue: 0,1:31:23.15,1:31:25.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就由他决定什么时候退休\N{\fnArial\fs30}he decides when he's done racing that was the deal
Dialogue: 0,1:31:25.89,1:31:30.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你好 我是他的律师 - 所以说你不厚道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- hi I'm Miss... - that was the deal you are not a nice guy little
Dialogue: 0,1:31:30.44,1:31:31.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老板 有句说句\N{\fnArial\fs30}look sir, I gotta say,
Dialogue: 0,1:31:31.89,1:31:35.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你可是好价钱弄了个挡泥板啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}you do make a quality mud flap in an affordable price
Dialogue: 0,1:31:36.20,1:31:39.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,斯特林先生 我们边开边聊吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}hey Sterling, why don't you and I take a drive and talk...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:39.89,1:31:41.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,亿万富翁之间的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Billionaire to billionaire
Dialogue: 0,1:31:54.45,1:31:57.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这孩子有两下 对吧博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}kids got a lot of stuff, huh Doc?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:59.60,1:32:02.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为她有位好老师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well she had a great teacher
Dialogue: 0,1:32:02.02,1:32:06.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,既然现在你可以决定何时退休\N{\fnArial\fs30}and now you get to decide when you're done racing
Dialogue: 0,1:32:06.61,1:32:09.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,之后打算干什么呢 臭臭 哦不 贴纸\N{\fnArial\fs30}so what's it gonna be stinky uh stickers
Dialogue: 0,1:32:11.46,1:32:13.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然是继续赛车\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna keep racing but
Dialogue: 0,1:32:13.66,1:32:17.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过在那之前 我有想做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}before that I have something I want to do
Dialogue: 0,1:32:24.08,1:32:27.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎来到著名的威利山丘\N{\fnArial\fs30}welcome all to historical Willy's butte
Dialogue: 0,1:32:27.17,1:32:30.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让我们来见证速度的奇迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}for today's great exhibition of speed
Dialogue: 0,1:32:33.87,1:32:37.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 谢谢各位 - 喷漆漂亮 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}- thanks guys - nice paint, kiddo
Dialogue: 0,1:32:37.63,1:32:40.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,借过 干得漂亮 51\N{\fnArial\fs30}hey hey, coming through get it done 51!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:41.60,1:32:44.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很棒的号码 是闪电麦坤的主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great number it was McQueen's idea
Dialogue: 0,1:32:44.88,1:32:47.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他觉得哈德也一定赞同\N{\fnArial\fs30}he felt Hud would've wanted you to have it
Dialogue: 0,1:32:47.32,1:32:51.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我喜欢 - 完美 非常老派\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I love it - oh it's perfect it's very old- school
Dialogue: 0,1:32:51.05,1:32:53.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有人提到老派了啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}did someone just say old school!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:57.62,1:32:59.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(超凡麦坤)
Dialogue: 0,1:32:59.65,1:33:01.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(致敬蓝天博士)
Dialogue: 0,1:33:05.25,1:33:07.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,新花样啊 我喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are trying something new I like it.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:08.01,1:33:10.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 哇哦 真狡猾！ - 我觉着\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wow subtle! - I figured if I'm
Dialogue: 0,1:33:10.10,1:33:13.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,既然我是领队 当然要有型\N{\fnArial\fs30}gonna be your crew chief I'd better do it in style
Dialogue: 0,1:33:13.91,1:33:15.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,斯特林先生会怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}what's Mr. Sterling gonna say
Dialogue: 0,1:33:15.94,1:33:21.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我其实更担心特克斯会怎么说 考虑到他买下了除锈灵公司\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm actually more worried about what Tex is gonna say, considering he bought rust-eze
Dialogue: 0,1:33:21.46,1:33:22.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢啦 特克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}thanks Tex!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:22.81,1:33:26.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我给了那个斯特林好大一笔钱呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I made that Sterling fella a Texas- sized offer
Dialogue: 0,1:33:27.17,1:33:28.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,准备好训练了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}so, ready to start training!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:28.90,1:33:31.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知啊 你准备好输了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know you ready to lose again.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:31.31,1:33:33.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但愿你的蓬蓬云还好使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I hope you got your fluffy cloud
Dialogue: 0,1:33:33.79,1:33:35.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的滴油盘呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope you got your drip pan!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:35.56,1:33:37.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,滴油盘带着 精神百倍呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got my drip pan and I'm taking my nap
Dialogue: 0,1:33:37.96,1:33:39.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 放马过来吧老家伙 - 路易吉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- bring it on old man.. - Luigi!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:40.10,1:33:40.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跑！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!
